{
  "doc_id": "scene.Chapter_36_highland_giants",
  "chapter": 36,
  "title": null,
  "when": "Unknown.scene_Chapter_36_highland_giants",
  "where": "Realm/Physical/Unknown",
  "scope": "narrative",
  "entities": [
    "unknown"
  ],
  "scene_id": "scene.Chapter_36_highland_giants",
  "segment_index": 0,
  "segment_count": 839,
  "segment_hash": "ee2aabbf4e8c",
  "block_title": "scene.Chapter_36_highland_giants",
  "beats": [
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Chapter 35 The highland giants"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The processor core lay paralysed on the ground."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She grabbed Dren’s arm—icy cold, trembling."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Look at me, Dren!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "You’re here! *Now!*\" Aldrin seized Judson, shouting names, grounding them in the present."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Soldiers locked eyes with comrades they’d mourned, shouting reassurances, anchoring them in shared reality."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The vibrating hum subsided."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The phantom dunes faded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Two hundred and fifty warriors stood solid, bewildered, but *real*, blinking in the harsh noon light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The flats were silent except for ragged breaths."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Tower loomed closer, its impossible shadow stretching long across the fractured salt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika met Oreck’s impassive lenses."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Geralt?\" she demanded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck shook his head."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their was a silence that overwhelmed the crowd.. 500 soldiers to tribute Geralt sacrifice Oreck spoke \"Deeper.."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Sage… awaits.\" And the army continued its march to the Tower."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck fell into step beside Mika, his voice low."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They didn’t arrive *with* us, Mika."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They bled *into* us."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "From *when*?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "From *where*?\" He gestured at the Tower."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"That place bends time."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt… he went *back*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "To save them.\" Mika frowned, struggling with the concept."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"But they’re here."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Saved."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "So why isn’t *he*?\" She recalled the fleeting glimpse in the bleed – Geralt, straining against impossible currents, his face etched with despair."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"I saw him, Oreck."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "In the… the distortion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He was fighting, pouring everything out."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then… nothing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He didn’t come through.\" The implication hung heavy between them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "If the warriors were ripped from oblivion back to *now*, but Geralt remained lost… Mika’s voice dropped to a whisper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"He succeeded… but failed himself?\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Tower’s entrance yawned before them – a jagged tear in seamless obsidian."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika halted the column."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Hold!\" Her command echoed strangely."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She scanned the warriors, their faces shifting between confusion and dawning horror."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They remembered dying."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They remembered *not* existing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And now… they remembered Geralt’s agonised face as he hurled himself into the temporal storm *for them*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One soldier, face pale beneath desert grime, stepped forward."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Commander Mika?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sir… Geralt… he *pushed* us out."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "At the end."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We felt it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Like… like being shoved through a closing door.\" His voice cracked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"He stayed behind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Holding it open.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika stared at the Tower’s dark maw."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt wasn’t lost."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He was trapped."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sacrificed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Sage awaited."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "So did answers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And maybe, just maybe, a way back."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She squared her shoulders, her voice cutting through the stunned silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Then we go *in*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We find him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We bring him home.\" She strode forward, the army surging behind her, their footsteps echoing into the shadowed throat of the Echo Tower."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air shimmered faintly, tasting of ozone and regret."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck matched her stride, his lenses whirring softly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He saw the fierce hope blazing in her eyes, the desperate certainty that Geralt was *here*, trapped within these obsidian walls."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Mika,\" he said, his voice low and urgent, cutting through the tramp of boots."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Listen."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "What you saw in the bleed..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt wasn't *here*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He wasn't bleeding *into* this Tower.\" He gestured sharply at the dark entrance swallowing them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"This isn't the source."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This isn't the passage *to* him.\" His lenses locked onto hers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"This is the Echo Tower."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Where Zypher took Geralts five loyal followers after finding their body's at the crash site."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We came *here*, Mika, hoping Geralt had somehow came here too, after his crash."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But after what you witnessed... him straining against the temporal currents, pouring himself out *there*...\" Oreck paused, the hum of the Tower vibratingthrough their boots."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"I don't want you to get your hopes up."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He might be anywhere."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Or any*when*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But not necessarily *here*.\"."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"I don't want you to get your hopes up."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The corridor inside was impossibly vast, walls curving upward into darkness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air grew colder, thick with the scent of ancient stone and something metallic."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Phantom whispers seemed to brush past their ears – fragments of conversations long silenced."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika kept walking, her jaw tight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck's words landed like stones."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Echo Tower."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zypher's folly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not Geralt's destination."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Just a desperate gamble."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Yet, the Sage resided here."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Knowledge resided here."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She glanced back at the soldiers, their faces etched with the shared trauma of non-existence and Geralt's sacrifice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their presence was his final act."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Hope isn't a weakness, Oreck,\" she stated, her voice echoing strangely in the cavernous hall."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It's fuel."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We find the Sage."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And hopefully some answers.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The deeper they went, the stranger the echoes became."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Footsteps multiplied into a phantom army marching unseen."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Voices fractured into overlapping whispers, snippets of Mika's own thoughts bouncing back: *\"...anywhen...\" \"...trapped...\" \"...bring him...\"*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "At a junction, she saw flickers – ghostly outlines of themselves moving down branching corridors moments before they did."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Ignore the echoes,\" Mika commanded, her voice firm despite the unnerving feedback."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Focus forward."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Sage's chamber.\" The Tower seemed designed to unravel sanity, reflecting doubt and fear back at its intruders."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The corridor abruptly ended at a circular chamber."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Utterly bare."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Utterly silent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No Sage."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No artifacts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only a single, immense mirror dominating the far wall."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its surface was liquid obsidian, swirling with impossible depth."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika approached cautiously."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her reflection didn't appear."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Instead, the mirror revealed a desolate courtyard under a bruised sky."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Five arched doorways stood open around its perimeter, dark mouths leading deeper into shadow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Standing calmly in the courtyard’s center, gazing directly *through* the mirror at Mika, was Zypher."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His expression was unreadable, a flicker of something like weary resignation in his eyes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He wasn't trapped; he was waiting."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He gestured slowly towards the five open chambers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika knew without seeing: Geralt's five loyal followers lay within."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This was the Echo's heart – a gateway, not a destination."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika met Zypher's gaze through the impossible glass."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Where is he?\" Her voice, amplified by the chamber, boomed like thunder."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zypher didn't flinch."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He simply pointed upwards, towards the bruised sky in the mirrored courtyard."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not towards chambers holding bodies, but towards the roiling heavens themselves."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The implication was chillingly clear: Geralt wasn't trapped in a room."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He was trapped *in the storm*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck hissed beside her, lenses clicking furiously."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The temporal currents..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He's *holding* the door open."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Still."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "From *then*.\" Mika stared at the sky beyond Zypher, her hope hardening into cold resolve."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Then we go *there*.\" She raised her hand towards the mirror's surface."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It yielded like cold, thick oil."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika plunged through, followed instantly by Oreck, Dren, and the wiry scout, Kael."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Behind them, the army watched, frozen, as the mirror swallowed their commanders."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The transition was instantaneous."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One moment, the sterile obsidian chamber; the next, the desolate courtyard under that bruised, turbulent sky."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air crackled with latent energy, humming against Mika's teeth."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zypher stood before them, calm as deep water."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He inclined his head slightly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Commander Mika."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck.\" His eyes lingered on Dren, a flicker of recognition – or perhaps sorrow – before settling back on Mika."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"You demand explanation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Suffice it to say, Geralt is my friend."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I commune with the Aeon Keepers through the Nephrati."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They foresaw Geralt's strength."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I was there when the Council gifted him the armor.\" His voice was low, resonant, carrying effortlessly over the ambient hum."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Finding his five loyal followers confirmed what I feared: Geralt wasn't with them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He'd already sacrificed himself to the temporal breach."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "So I saved what I could."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I brought them *here*.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He gestured towards the five open doorways."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Within the shadows, Mika could just discern still forms lying on biers of shimmering energy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The Echo Chamber facilitates resurrection,\" Zypher continued."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"But it demands choice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They battle oblivion now, deciding whether to return."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "If they choose life, they will emerge... themselves."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Wholly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Loyal to Geralt unto death, just as they were."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt himself?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He hasn't passed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I cannot verify it, but I *know* it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He endures."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And I expect him to find his own way back.\" Zypher's gaze swept over Mika, Oreck, Dren, and Kael."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Your army is free to depart or stay."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They are welcome here."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But Geralt... he will come."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He always finds the path.\" His eyes returned to the writhing sky."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Even if he must forge it himself.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "+++++++++++++++++"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "As he climbed the crater’s northern rim, leaving the fused glass behind, the harsh ochre sands returned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Edge of the World Chasm loomed ahead, a monstrous gash splitting the Scorch, its depths lost in perpetual shadow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt paused on the precipice, the wind whipping his scarf, tasting of dust and the void below."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Movement caught his eye – not Chronohounds, but forms emerging from the dunes below the chasm’s lip."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Massive bodies, Tufts of fur the color of dried blood and burnt sand, a visual scar of how harsh this terrain was to endure living in, lumbered into view. *Dregans*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Desert predators."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Each stood thrice his height, their powerful hind legs built for bounding leaps, their forelimbs ending in shovel-like claws for digging."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Useless, leathery wings, too small for flight, flapped agitatedly against their flanks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Deadliest of all were the thick, muscular tails, tipped with a crushing, bony grip capable of pulverizing stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A pack."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ten, maybe twelve."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Normally, they’d scent prey instantly – a lone human was easy meat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt tensed, hand instinctively going to his blade hilt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This many would be overwhelming."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They didn’t charge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They simply… lined up."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Formed a rough corridor leading away from the Heart’s crater, towards the faint, treacherous path skirting the chasm’s edge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their obsidian eyes, like chips of volcanic glass, fixed not on him as prey, but *through* him, towards the scarred depression he’d just climbed from."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their nostrils flared, tasting the lingering psychic residue – the shared grief, the acknowledged pain."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One, a massive elder with cracked horns, lowered its head slightly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A low, rumbling groan vibrated through the sand beneath Geralt’s boots, not aggressive, but resonant."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It echoed the Heart’s weary thrum."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The applicator remained silent; no threat detected."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The dragon armor hummed softly, echoing Zaron’s shared sorrow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron waited in the silence for a few heartbeats, his spirit woven into the armor's core, until the Dregans' psychic imprint could no longer be felt resonating in the sand beneath Geralt’s feet."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only then did the ancient dragon acknowledge their actions with a surge of grim respect through the armor’s neural link. *\"That silent hum,\"* Zaron’s voice resonated within Geralt’s mind, sharp as obsidian shards, *\"is not traditional Dregan behavior."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They are predators by nature."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They screech like sirens."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The sound alone once shattered Giant's Rock into brittle glass that powdered in the wind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence… speaks of recognition."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Or mourning.\"* The implication hung heavy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Dregans, ancient denizens of the Scorch, perhaps sensed the shared burden Geralt had carried from the Heart."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They offered passage, not attack."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The path northward shifted dramatically."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The choking dunes gave way to rocky plateaus, the air cooling as elevation climbed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Snow-capped peaks loomed in the distance—the first fingers of the Crescent Mountains."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Scrubby trees, twisted but alive, dotted the landscape where groundwater seeped up through fractured stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sand yielded to gravel, then to packed earth strewn with hardy alpine grasses."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The oppressive heat lifted, replaced by a wind carrying the scent of pine and distant ice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt crested a ridge, muscles burning from the climb but lungs grateful for the cleaner air."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Below, nestled in a sheltered valley bowl beside a rushing glacial stream, stood a small encampment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sturdy hide tents clustered around a central fire pit."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sharpened stakes formed a defensive perimeter—overkill for such a remote location."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt counted eight figures moving with military precision among the tents."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "All wore patched leathers, but their movements spoke of Legion training."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "As Geralt descended the slope, every head turned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Weapons didn’t rise, but hands drifted towards blades and spear shafts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Postures shifted subtly—ready, assessing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He kept his own hands visible, away from his sword."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Star Needle emblem pulsed faintly on his vambrace."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "By the time he reached the perimeter stakes, only two figures remained visible outside the tents—a broad-shouldered man sharpening a spearhead, and a woman with grey streaking her dark braids, tending the fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The others had melted into the shadows, watchful ghosts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt stopped ten paces out."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The woman at the fire straightened slowly, wiping ash-stained hands on her leggings."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her eyes, sharp and wary beneath scarred brows, locked onto Geralt’s face."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then flickered to the dragon armor, gleaming dully in the thin mountain light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Distrust warred with dawning recognition."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A lifetime of shared suffering vibrated in the silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Commander?\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her voice was rough, disbelieving. The man sharpening the spear froze mid-stroke."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt nodded once."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Sella.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A choked sound escaped her."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The spear dropped from the man’s hands with a clatter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He surged forward, disbelief melting into fierce joy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Geralt!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "By the shattered chains!\" He grabbed Geralt’s forearm in the old Legion grip—forearm to forearm, a grip forged in the slave pits before they had names."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The woman, Sella, joined them, her calloused hand gripping Geralt’s other shoulder with bruising intensity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her eyes scanned the armor again, lingering on the subtle dragon-scale pattern fused into the pauldron."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"We know the feel of that power,\" she rasped."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It whispers of old masters."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But *you*...\" Her grip tightened."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"You broke our collars on the Bloodstone Fields."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Fought beside us when the sky fell.\" The memory—desperate charges against Anunnaki overseers, the roar of breaking chains—hung thick between them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Trust wasn't given lightly here."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was earned in blood and shared defiance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They trusted *him*, armor or not."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The shadows stirred as others emerged cautiously, drawn by the raw emotion resonating from their leader’s reunion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The camp was spare but efficient."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Smoked meat hung near the fire pit; sharpened stakes ringed the tents."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sella gestured Geralt towards a hide stool near the flames."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Found this cleft months back,\" she explained, pouring bitter kaff from a dented pot."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Good water."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Few predators big enough to threaten us.\" She nodded towards the peaks looming above."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The Giants pass higher."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We stay low.\" Geralt noted the tension coiled beneath her calm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Hunted?\" Sella’s eyes hardened."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Not beasts."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Raiders."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "From the lowlands."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They sniffed us out last moon-cycle."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Took two.\" She spat into the fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"We retrieved one."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Buried him yesterday.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A lean scout named Jorik leaned forward, his gaze sharp."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"You heading deeper, Commander?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Towards the giants?\" Geralt nodded, sipping the harsh brew."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Star Needle resonance was a constant pull northward."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sella exchanged a weighted glance with the others."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The Giants,\" she said slowly, \"they don't come down."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Don't want visitors."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They see...\" she tapped her temple, \"...*knowledge*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Strength of mind, not blade."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They know what this armor is.\" She paused, her voice dropping."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They know *where* it came from.\" The applicator hummed softly in Geralt’s mind, confirming her words with fragmented data: *Highland Giants: Isolationist."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Cognitive Ascendancy culture."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Primary archive: Annunaki pre-collapse…*"
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"They won't welcome you,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik warned. \"Not wearing that. They see it... as stolen fire.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt set his cup down."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The dragon armor pulsed faintly, reacting to the mountain’s proximity and the Giants’ unseen gaze."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"I need their knowledge,\" he stated flatly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The Needle Spires."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Accessing the Akashic records.\" A ripple of surprise went through the small group."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sella stared at him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The Spires?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They're... buried."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Lost.\" Geralt met her gaze."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"One isn't."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Buried, yes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But not lost."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Giants guard it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I need to configure it.\" He felt the applicator stir, analyzing pathways."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"To find an army.\" Silence fell, thick with unspoken questions and the crackle of the fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sella leaned back, her scarred face thoughtful in the flickering light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The path is treacherous,\" she finally said."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The Giants watch."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And worse things crawl near their peaks.\" She glanced at her companions, a silent agreement passing between them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"We know the lower slopes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We'll take you as far as the Whispering Stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Beyond that...\" She shrugged."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"You face the Giants alone.\" The offer was simple, born of loyalty forged in chains."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt inclined his head."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Thank you, Sella.\" Tomorrow, the ascent would begin."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The mountain waited."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The scout, Jorik, stepped forward quietly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He wasn't imposing like the others, wiry and sharp-eyed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Without a word, he untied a long, dark bundle from his back."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Unwrapping cured hides, he revealed a weapon unlike any Geralt had seen: a bow taller than Jorik himself, crafted from layers of horn and sinew laminated onto a core of dark, resilient wood."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It gleamed faintly under the firelight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Found the wood higher up,\" Jorik muttered, his voice rough."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Near a place where the Giants left offerings."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Horn from a mountain beast that tried to eat me.\" He strung it with startling ease, the thick sinew singing taut."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"No metal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No pulleys."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Just... leverage.\" He handed Geralt an arrow – thick shaft, obsidian head shaped like a leaf."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Draws heavier than any Legion bow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shoots farther.\" Geralt hefted the arrow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The craftsmanship was primal, lethal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"First of its kind?\" Jorik nodded curtly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Call it necessity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Raiders shoot farther.\" Geralt sensed the raw potential."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"You climb with me.\" It wasn't a question."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik hesitated, glancing at Sella."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She gave a single, sharp nod."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"To the Stone,\" she confirmed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The scout met Geralt's gaze, a flicker of unease beneath his resolve."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Beyond the Stone... the Giants *see*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They feel trespass.\" Geralt understood the fear."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"We face it together.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The night passed under a canopy of icy stars."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The fire burned low."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sentries watched the perimeter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt sat apart, not sleeping, feeling the pull of the Star Needle Spire resonate deep within him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He sensed a different watchfulness too – ancient, damp."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not hostile, but alien."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "From the distant swamps clinging to the mountain's lower flanks, he felt unseen eyes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The applicator confirmed it: *Psychic signatures detected: Pattern: 'Neferati'."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Classification: Aeon-Keeper thought-form manifestations.* They were observing, flowing through the mist like sentient shadows."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their presence was a low hum beneath the mountain's chroniton thrum."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They knew him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They knew the armor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were the silent architects who had subtly guided him towards the Aeon Keepers long ago, weaving possibilities."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They wouldn't climb with him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their help was whispers on the wind, influencing perception, easing the Giants' hostility from afar."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt acknowledged their unseen gaze."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Allies of necessity, bound by secrets older than nations."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His thoughts drifted northward, beyond the peaks, to Mika."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Soon."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He clenched his fist, the dragon scale gauntlet gleaming coldly. *Soon.*"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The predawn light painted the peaks in shades of bone and ash."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt stood ready beside Jorik."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The scout wore layered furs, his longbow slung and a quiver of heavy arrows on his back."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His jaw was set tight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sella clasped Geralt's forearm once more."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Safe passage, Commander."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Find your army.\" She nodded curtly at Jorik."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Watch his back.\" The ascent began immediately, steep and silent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air grew thinner, sharper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They traversed scree slopes and knife-edge ridges."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik moved with uncanny silence, his eyes constantly scanning the rocks above."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt felt the Giants' gaze intensify – a chilling pressure, like glaciers grinding against his mind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It wasn't anger, but profound disinterest bordering on disdain."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They saw the armor, the applicator, the stolen fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They saw a trespasser."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Neferati's subtle influence felt like thin oil on turbulent water, barely holding the Giants' outright rejection at bay."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "As they approached a massive, weathered monolith etched with faint, swirling symbols – the Whispering Stone – Jorik stopped."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"This is it,\" he breathed, unease thick in his voice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Stone hummed faintly, resonating with the mountain's disapproval."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Beyond it, the path vanished into sheer cliffs and swirling mist."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik looked at Geralt, conflict stark in his eyes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Commander... beyond here...\" His hand tightened on his bow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt faced him squarely."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The Spire isn't just *my* path, Jorik. its where i find my answers, Where the Harbinger filed the Five.\" Geralt gestured towards the mist-shrouded peaks, doubt for the first time crossed his mind.. what does any of thos have to do with Mika?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She was by the crashsite and not seen from since then..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And the five.. they were on that ship with me when it crashed.. when did they get filed away?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shaking the thoughts away he continued."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Knowledge buried there can break chains far heavier than ours."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Knowledge the Giants hoard, while others suffer, but giants in general.. they are stewards of this land.. at all costs we need them on our side as much as they will need us\" He tapped the Star Needle emblem on his vambrace."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"This resonance pulls north."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It’s our compass."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Yours feels it too, deeper than fear."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Trust that.\" Jorik stared at the mist, then down at his bow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He remembered the raiders, the stolen Legionaries, the helplessness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He remembered crafting this weapon from necessity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His jaw clenched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They'll see us,\" he muttered, not looking at Geralt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"They'll feel us climbing.\" \"Then let them see determination,\" Geralt countered softly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"And let them add humanity to the first page in their archives.\" Jorik met Geralt’s gaze."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The fear didn't vanish, but resolve hardened beneath it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He gave a single, sharp nod, adjusted his quiver, and stepped deliberately past the Whispering Stone into the mist."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The mountain's disapproval sharpened instantly, a psychic wind threatening to push them back."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Ice Drakes\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": ". Faster than thought, Jorik planted his feet on a narrow ledge, nocked an arrow, and drew the massive horn bow in one fluid motion. The sinew groaned. He sighted, exhaled, and released. The arrow blurred, striking the lead drake squarely in the throat. It shrieked, plummeting past them. Before the others could react, Jorik had another arrow nocked, fired, striking the second drake's wing joint. It spiraled away, shrieking. The third hesitated. Geralt drew his blade, but Jorik's third arrow took it through the eye. Silence crashed back, broken only by the wind. Jorik lowered the bow, breathing hard, a savage grin briefly touching his lips. \"Told you it drew heavy,\" he rasped. Geralt stared at the falling shapes. \"Hell of a bowman,\" he acknowledged. They climbed higher. The mist parted briefly, revealing a colossal cave mouth high above – the Giant's threshold. The Giants knew they were coming. They also knew Jorik could shoot. The path narrowed. Mika felt closer than ever."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Suddenly, the rock beneath Geralt’s boot dissolved."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not crumbled – *flowed*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The ledge liquefied into swirling vapour."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He pitched sideways into thin air."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik yelled, grabbing futilely."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The mountain itself was rejecting them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt plummeted – then slammed onto an invisible platform of solidified mist."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It shimmered beneath him, icy cold."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Looking up, he saw Jorik frozen mid-reach, suspended on another disc of cloud-stone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Before them, impossibly tall, stood Althurion, First Speaker."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His skin held the blue-white sheen of glacial ice, his eyes the pale, infinite expanse of a winter sky."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Tendrils of cloud wreathed his form."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He didn't speak; the harmonics emerged directly from the vibrating air itself, deep and resonant, making Geralt’s bones hum. **\"Trespassers.\"** The word wasn't accusation, merely fact. **\"You wear stolen fire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "You climb with violence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "You disturb the Aetherhold's song.\"** His gaze, ancient and utterly alien, locked onto Geralt’s armor, then flicked to Jorik’s bow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The mountain’s disapproval solidified into crushing pressure."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt felt the Neferati’s subtle influence fraying like old rope."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This was raw Giantsong, unmediated."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt forced his breathing steady."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Panic was death here."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He met Althurion’s sky-pale eyes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"We seek not violence, but understanding,\" he called out, voice straining against the harmonic pressure."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He gestured to the Star Needle emblem."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"This resonance calls us north."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not for conquest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "To mend what was broken.\" He glanced at Jorik, suspended nearby."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The bow defends."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It does not initiate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "We climb seeking knowledge buried deep – knowledge of the Needle Spire you guard.\" He didn't plead."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He stated."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He anchored himself in his purpose: Mika, the Five, the scattered Legion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The applicator flared weakly, attempting to map the Giant’s harmonic structure – impossibly complex."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Althurion tilted his massive head, studying Geralt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air thrummed with silent assessment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The pressure didn't lessen, but it shifted – less rejection, more profound scrutiny. **\"Understanding?\"** the harmonics resonated, tinged with skepticism colder than the wind. **\"Mortals grasp fragments."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They shatter harmonies.\"** His gaze lingered on the armor. **\"This vessel speaks of shattering.\"**"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt straightened on the disc of mist."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His voice cut through the harmonic hum, sharp with conviction."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It speaks of survival."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Of defiance against entropy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Against *Xal'Zirith*.\" He projected the name, letting the Harbinger’s psychic stain resonate faintly through his applicator – a discordant counterpoint to the Giantsong."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Althurion recoiled microscopically, a ripple passing through his cloud-wisp form. **\"The Devourer’s stain...\"** The harmonics deepened, vibrating with grim recognition. **\"It festers across the skein.\"** He studied Geralt anew, the pale eyes narrowing. **\"You wield stolen fire against the Devourer’s shadow?\"** The question hung, heavy with implication."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt met his gaze unflinchingly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"I wield it *because* of the shadow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "To pull back what was taken.\" He gestured northward, towards the unseen spire’s pull."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The Spire holds answers locked away."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Answers the Devourer fears.\" Althurion was silent for a long moment."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The mist-platforms solidified further beneath their feet."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The crushing pressure eased fractionally, replaced by intense, humming focus. **\"Harmony against discord,\"** the harmonics resonated, softer now. **\"A worthy trial."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But understanding…\"** The Giant’s gaze swept over them both, lingering on Jorik’s tense posture, Geralt’s cracked armor. **\"...must be earned.\"** He raised a hand."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The path ahead shimmered, revealing not rock, but swirling clouds forming a treacherous bridge deeper into the Aetherhold."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The first test awaited."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cloud-bridge felt like walking through solidified thought."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Each step resonated with harmonics, vibrating up Geralt’s legs and into his core."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It demanded balance – not just physical, but intentional."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A misstep in focus, a spike of fear from Jorik, and the mist beneath their boots would thin alarmingly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Althurion walked effortlessly ahead, his form blending with the vapour. **\"Intent shapes substance,\"** his harmonics hummed, a lesson woven into the air itself. **\"Anger?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The bridge trembles."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Doubt?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It dissolves."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Clarity?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It holds.\"** Geralt felt the applicator strain, analyzing the harmonic frequencies, trying to find a stable resonance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was useless."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This wasn't logic; it was *will*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He pictured Mika’s determined smile, Varik’s loyalty, the desperate hope of the scattered 250."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Purpose solidified."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His steps grew firmer."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Beside him, Jorik breathed slowly, eyes fixed on Geralt’s back, drawing resolve from him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The bridge steadied."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Ahead, the mist parted onto a vast, impossible plaza carved from living cloud and gleaming ice-crystal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Structures shimmered into view – libraries formed from frozen lightning, archives held in suspended raindrops."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And standing sentinel were more Giants, their frost-pale eyes watching, waiting."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Althurion turned, facing them fully on the plaza's edge. **\"You seek the Buried Resonance,\"** he stated, harmonics resonating with the deep thrum of the mountain itself. **\"The Annunaki artifact beneath our peaks."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not a trophy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A ward.\"** His gaze pinned Geralt. **\"Its activation risks unleashing what it contains."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Akashic Records are not mere data."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They are *potential*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Unfiltered, they consume.\"** He gestured towards the crystalline archives. **\"Prove you understand consequence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Prove you seek not just power, but wisdom’s anchor.\"** The implication was clear: Access required a demonstration of harmony beyond mere survival."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt felt the Star Needle emblem pulse against his chest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Spire wasn’t just a tool."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was a responsibility echoing the Giants’ own guardianship."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He glanced at Jorik, whose hand rested protectively on his unique bow – a symbol of necessity tempered by purpose."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Humanity’s footprint wasn't just defiance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was the understanding Althurion demanded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt squared his shoulders."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Show me the trial.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The First Speaker gestured silently."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A section of the cloud plaza solidified into a vast, circular dais etched with harmonic sigils that pulsed faintly with inner light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "At its center rested a plinth of flawless blue ice, holding a sphere of swirling, captured storm-light – raw, chaotic chroniton energy. **\"Harmonize the Vortex,\"** Althurion commanded, his harmonics resonating with grave finality. **\"Channel its fury into a stable resonance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not suppression."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Integration."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Failure unravels the dais… and you.\"** The vortex hissed, lashing the air with temporal static that stung Geralt’s skin."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik instinctively stepped back, eyes wide."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt approached alone, his cracked applicator spitting warnings: *Chaotic chroniton density exceeding safe thresholds*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zaron’s spirit within the armor flared, a low growl against the storm’s roar."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This wasn't brute force."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was precision conducting."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He closed his eyes, recalling Kaelen’s ruthless drills in the Nexus – feeling the rhythm beneath the chaos."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He extended his hands, applicator whining as he mapped the vortex’s jagged frequencies."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not dominance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dialogue."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He wove his tripartite signature – armor’s defiant stability, applicator’s meticulous structure, his own unwavering focus on Mika’s retrieval – *into* the storm’s dissonance, seeking points of congruence, threads he could gently guide."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pain seared through him as the vortex resisted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Temporal shards sliced psychic feedback across his mind."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He grounded himself in the image of the Whispering Stone's symbols, the Giants' own language of harmony."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Slowly, agonizingly, he found a screaming frequency within the storm and answered it not with force, but with a counter-harmony of focused purpose."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The vortex bucked violently."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A sigil on the dais flickered out."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt poured more will into the weave, his vision blurring."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He saw not just energy, but the potential Althurion warned of – timelines fracturing, knowledge devouring seekers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He channeled that understanding into his resonance, shaping the fury into a pulsing, contained sphere of ordered light atop the plinth."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence fell abruptly, heavy and profound."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The storm-light was now a calm, humming orb."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt swayed, blood trickling from his nose."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The applicator's casing groaned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Althurion nodded once, a deep, resonant hum vibrating from his chest. **\"Understanding witnessed.\"** He turned, leading them towards a towering archway carved from glacial ice. **\"The Heartpeak awaits.\"**"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Beyond the arch stretched a narrow causeway of pure, transparent ice spanning a fathomless chasm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Far below, embedded like a splinter in the mountain’s core, pulsed the apex of the Needle Spire – a colossal spike of dark Annunaki metal humming with dormant power."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its chroniton resonance vibrated through Geralt’s bones, calling fiercely."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Althurion stopped at the causeway’s edge. **\"The Buried Resonance,\"** he intoned. **\"Its core remains dormant."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "To activate its archive… you must resonate *with* its harmonics."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But know this: The spire’s activation echoes across the deep skein."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It will draw attention.\"** His pale sky-eyes held Geralt’s. **\"Is your purpose worth that beacon?\"** Geralt stared at the spire, feeling the applicator’s fractured shell resonate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Purpose hardened within him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Five."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The scattered Legion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It is,\" he stated, voice echoing in the frozen air."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He stepped onto the ice bridge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Spire pulsed brighter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The true configuration began."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Needle Spire’s resonance wasn't merely a hum; it was a complex lattice of chroniton pathways, layered and interwoven like Annunaki code."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt knelt before its apex, embedded in the icy floor of the Heartpeak cavern."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He placed his palms on the cold metal."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The applicator flared, projecting shimmering strands of light – fractured, but functional."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He felt the spire’s dormant potential: a repository designed for Akashic Records, yes, but fundamentally a *harvester*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Built to siphon vrill energy from temporal eddies and channel it for power… or teleportation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His lips thinned. *Annunaki tech.* Crude compared to his Void Spire training."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He didn't need vrill extraction."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He didn't crave unstable teleportation corridors between spiers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He’d navigated the Continuum Nexus itself, where space-time flowed like water."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His need was sublime: a silent, surgical incision into the Akashic pathway itself."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "To enter the vast halls he only vaguely remembers when he was summoned their when presented the armor by the aaon keepers themselves."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The void spiers..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The needle spiers..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They all share one fundamental connection.."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Grand spire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This was not something the training provided."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This is the pulse, the pull tugging on his sleeve."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This is knowledge that chose you."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And it chose me."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His fingers danced in the air, guided by the applicator’s projections."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He bypassed the primary vrill collectors entirely."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Instead, he delved deep into the spire’s foundational chroniton lattice – a structure older than the Annunaki modifications."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He rewrote protocols, subverting the spire’s purpose."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He silenced the broadcast harmonics that would announce its activation across the skein."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No beacon."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "No fanfare."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He programmed it not as a harvester or gate, but as a *key*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A silent, resonant probe tuned solely to *his* tripartite signature – applicator, armor, will."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Its sole function: to map the deeper Akashic currents, seeking the unified connection."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He carved his intent into the spire’s core: The spire’s hum shifted, deepening into an almost imperceptible thrum beneath the mountain’s song."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Configuration complete."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Specific."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Undetectable."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The cavern plunged into profound silence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The spire’s dark metal now pulsed with a deep, internal light – resonant, but contained."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt felt its new purpose humming through his armor: To light, and to Sound.."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "To Luminaire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "To the Resonant Keeper whose signature was the final compass."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He rose, turning towards the causeway."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Althurion watched, a silent mountain."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt met his gaze."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The spire sings only for my purpose,\" Geralt stated."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It brings no threat."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only answers.\" The Giant gave a slow, resonant nod. **\"Harmony endures.\"**"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik shifted his horn bow, eyes wide with awe."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt gripped his shoulder."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Stay sharp,\" he murmured."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The path ahead... it won't be stone.\" Jorik managed a tight nod."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Wherever it leads, Commander.\" Geralt turned back to the spire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He didn't activate it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He let his tripartite signature bleed into its newly forged lattice – applicator’s precision, armor’s defiance, his unwavering focus on Mika."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The spire *recognized* him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air shimmered violently, not tearing, but *folding*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Reality buckled silently."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "One heartbeat, Geralt and Jorik stood before the Heartpeak spire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The next, they stood upon an obsidian stairwell descending into infinite darkness."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Behind them, the spire’s resonance faded like a closing door."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They descended."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The stairs were impossibly smooth, cold beneath their boots, each step echoing faintly into the abyss."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Around them, the Akashic Records unfolded."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not as dusty archives, but as living starscapes – constellations shifting into faces, battles, moments frozen in time."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Nebulae swirled into equations, galaxies condensed into whispered secrets."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air hummed with the weight of all existence, pressing against Geralt’s senses."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik gasped softly, stumbling as a phantom wave crashed silently beside them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"It's... everything,\" he breathed, overwhelmed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt kept his eyes fixed downward."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The stairs felt unfamiliar, yet deeply known."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They twisted, branched, reformed – not carved, but *willed* into being."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He wasn't following a path; he was forging it with every step, guided by the spire’s silent beacon towards Mika’s unique resonance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The descent felt eternal, the starscape pressing closer, whispering forgotten lore and futures unmade."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Instinct screamed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He halted, shoving Jorik back behind him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air *crackled*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Before them, the starfield fractured violently."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not stars, but *aspects*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pure, blinding light coalesced into a radiant, feminine form – intent etched into its luminous contours."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Simultaneously, primal sound coalesced into a resonating, vibrating counterpart – raw, unstable power humming like an overloaded reactor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They weren't separate entities."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were halves of a terrifying whole, moments after a catastrophic division."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Light Aspect pulsed with desperate navigational urgency – a map screaming its destination."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Sound Aspect vibrated with agonizing pressure, seeking release, a projectile primed for launch."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "*Prime Catalyst.* The knowledge slammed into Geralt – not learned, but *remembered* from the Heartpeak spire’s deep configuration."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This wasn’t Luminara *in* stasis."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This was Luminara *as* ignition."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Seed Jump was mid-flight."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Sound Aspect – the volatile Activator – was already hurtling through the chaos of the damaged Akashic pathways, aimed towards an impossibly distant Spire."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Success meant a new node ignited."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Failure meant… annihilation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And the Light Aspect remained, the Locator, radiating frantic purpose, already calculating the next iteration should this one fail."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Light Aspect turned its luminous gaze upon Geralt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It wasn't recognition; it was *assessment*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Raw Akashic potential flowed around him, reacting to his tripartite signature."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The spire’s silent probe, tuned perfectly to Mika’s retrieval, resonated unexpectedly with the Locator’s desperate need."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt saw it: a fleeting harmonic overlap."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His configured spire wasn’t just a key; it was a potential anchor point *within* the chaotic jump-pathway Luminara had been forced to use."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Light Aspect shifted, its navigational focus momentarily locking onto *him*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The implication was staggering: His presence offered a stable resonance point amidst the chaos."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A lifeline."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A chance for the Catalyst’s halves to synchronize *now*, bypassing the perilous void-crossing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The risk was immense – stabilizing that volatile Sound Aspect mid-transit could tear reality apart."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But the Light Aspect, the essence of Luminara’s persistent will, flowed towards Geralt, resonating with his purpose."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It wasn't asking permission."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was *choosing* the anchor he represented."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air screamed with impending fusion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Commander!\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik yelled, staggering back as primal harmonics threatened to shatter his bones. Geralt braced himself, Star Needle applicator flaring crimson warnings. He saw the Light Aspect – pure information, Mika’s face flickering within its luminous matrix – merge with his tripartite signature. It wasn't possession; it was resonance amplification. His senses exploded. Suddenly, he perceived the Sound Half’s terrifying trajectory: a screaming comet of raw chroniton fury hurtling through a corridor where spatial dimensions frayed like rotten cloth. It was nanoseconds from catastrophic dispersion. The Light Aspect *used* Geralt’s spire-tuned awareness, projecting Mika’s resonant signature like a homing flare directly into the Sound Half’s path. Not guidance. A *command*. *Redirect.* The Sound Aspect obeyed instantly, violently altering course. It wasn't heading for a distant spire anymore. It was plunging *towards them*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Impact was imminent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt acted on pure Void Spire instinct."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He didn't fight the Catalyst’s flow; he *conducted* it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shoving Jorik bodily behind him onto a solidified step-platform, Geralt slammed his palms downward onto the obsidian stair."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Star Needle applicator shrieked, projecting latticework harmonics directly into the Akashic substrate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He didn't try to contain the Sound Aspect's fury."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He *channeled* it."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Using the Light Aspect’s navigational precision flooding his mind, he shaped the screaming chroniton torrent into a focused beam, directing its colossal energy *through* the stair beneath his hands."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The obsidian underfoot didn't shatter; it *resonated*, transforming into a lens of pure harmonic potential."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Sound Aspect struck the focal point."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Light and Sound collided not with destruction, but with blinding, resonant *integration*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The stairwell vanished in a silent detonation of stabilized power."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Silence descended, thick and profound."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Akashic starscape slowly reformed around them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Standing where the focal point had been, radiating impossible calm amidst fading chroniton sparks, was Luminara: whole, unified, and terrifyingly present."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her eyes, swirling galaxies of ancient knowledge, fixed on Geralt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A faint harmonic hum resonated deep within Jorik's bones – the newly anchored Spire node, born not on a distant world, but *here*, within the Akashic pathway itself."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara inclined her head, her voice a chorus echoing with the weight of countless Seed Jumps."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"You provided the anchor, Resonant Keeper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "An unforeseen variable.\" Her gaze shifted towards the depths where Mika’s signature pulsed faintly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Now."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Shall we retrieve what *you* seek?\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The implications slammed into Geralt."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara wasn’t a destination; she was the ignition key itself, cyclically sacrificing fragments of her essence across the cosmos."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His spire-tuned resonance hadn't just illuminated Mika’s location; it had offered the Catalyst a stable fulcrum mid-leap, transforming a desperate void-crossing into instantaneous integration."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "This node wasn't merely *activated*; it was *forged* around his purpose."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The risk hadn't vanished; it had merely shifted form."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Stabilizing the volatile Activator mid-flight had anchored Luminara *here*, within the Akashic flow, tying her immense power directly to Geralt’s quest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her presence wasn't passive aid; it was a live conduit to the deepest currents of existence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara stepped forward, her form shimmering slightly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Your Legion Commander,\" she stated, her voice resonating with the Akashic pulse, \"did not merely endure the void."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They *clung*.\" She gestured, and the starscape fractured into a vision: soldiers adrift in temporal eddies, drowning in oblivion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Then, a familiar resonance pulsed – Mika’s raw, desperate focus on Geralt’s survival, amplified by the temporal bleed rippling from his assault on Xal'Zirith’s scar."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Your fury tore the scar, Geralt, but it spilled chroniton chaos outward."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Within that bleed, Mika’s unwavering belief in you became a lifeline."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her echo of existence, her primal drive to reunite, resonated across the Eddy.\" The vision shifted: warriors latching onto Mika’s psychic signature, pulled from non-existence not by Geralt’s straining hands, but by the anchor forged from *her* love and *his* relentless refusal to yield."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Where others felt loss, you pushed harder."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Your determination sculpted the Eddy itself."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Your Legion didn’t escape oblivion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were *salvaged* by the bond you share.\" Luminara’s galactic eyes held his."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"This node isn’t just my anchor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It’s the confluence of your purpose.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "////////"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara's form flickered, translucent at the edges."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"I am... incomplete still.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her voice held strain"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "beneath its harmonic resonance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"What you see here –"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Light and Sound reunified – is my consciousness"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "restored within the Akashic flow.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She gestured downward, toward the archway."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"But I am"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Resonant Keeper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Light to navigate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sound to activate. but I cannot persist in this form forever, when I can bring these energies together, I can manifest into the material existence .\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her form wavered, unable to solidify."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"My material"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "aspect remains a corrupted connection."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I cannot take form"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "in your world."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Cannot walk solid ground."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Cannot manifest"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "beyond these walls.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A vision flashed: a pyramid, roots coiling around"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "obsidian, corruption bleeding through water, a"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "luminous potential struggling to materialize."
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Free my material anchor, Geralt. Purge what prevents"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "my manifestation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only then can I *choose* physical form."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Only then can I walk beside you.\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "///////////"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The stairs beneath them rippled."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Obsidian smoothed into polished black stone, veined with faint, pulsing chroniton light."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "An archway materialized ahead, framing not starscapes, but a familiar, shadowed corridor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air shifted – damp stone, ozone, and the distant murmur of voices."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt knew this scent, this resonance."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Echo Tower."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Zypher’s domain."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Where Mika had marched his resurrected warriors."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Where Geralt had felt only phantom traces before."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Now, the connection blazed like a beacon."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Jorik inhaled sharply beside him, gripping his bow tighter."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Sir... that’s...\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "say",
      "who": "unknown",
      "text": "\"The way down,\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt finished, his voice rough. Below that Akashic library lay the path not just to answers, but to *her*. To the Legion pulled back from the brink by the force of Mika’s faith and his own indomitable will. The stairs solidified, leading unmistakly towards the archway. Through it, Geralt glimpsed flickering torchlight on rough-hewn stone – the entrance hall of the Echo Tower. He could almost hear the muffled tread of boots, the low hum of displaced warriors grounding themselves. He felt Mika’s presence there, a fierce, familiar warmth cutting through the Tower’s psychic chill. She was close. Real. Waiting."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Luminara remained behind, a silent sentinel at the confluence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The path is open,\" she resonated, her form beginning to dissolve back into the Akashic flow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"This place is yours as needed throughout your journey, ill be here awaiting, but go, Claim your reward, Resonant Keeper."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The echoes await their Commander.\" Geralt didn't hesitate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He strode forward, Jorik a step behind, the applicator humming softly, no longer screaming warnings but resonating with anticipation."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air thickened as they passed through the archway, the weight of the Akashic Records lifting, replaced by the tangible, charged atmosphere of the Tower."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Torchlight danced on the walls ahead."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Around a bend, voices grew clearer – the low murmur of soldiers, a sharp command ringing out."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s voice."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt quickened his pace, the final steps echoing loudly in the sudden quiet of the corridor."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He rounded the corner.."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Salt crunched under his boot."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika stiffened, sensing presence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Slowly, she turned."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her eyes widened, disbelief warring with desperate hope."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Geralt?\" Her voice cracked."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"You... forged the path?\""
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The corridor fell utterly silent."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Soldiers froze mid-motion, mouths agape."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Oreck’s lenses snapped into focus."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Dren dropped a water canteen, its clatter echoing strangely."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt stood framed in the archway, dust from the void swirling faintly around his boots, his dragon armor gleaming dully in the torchlight, eyes locked solely on Mika."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Months of separation, of battles fought across fractured timelines, of feeling her absence like a phantom limb, vanished in the raw shock of reunion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika’s breath hitched."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The fierce Commander dissolved, replaced by the woman who’d believed against oblivion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She took one faltering step forward, then another, breaking into a run."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"GERALT!\" She crashed into him, arms wrapping around his armored torso with bone-jarring force."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He caught her instantly, crushing her against him, his face burying in her sweat-streaked hair, inhaling the scent of ozone, dust, and *her*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His arms trembled, holding her as if she were the only solid thing in a dissolving universe."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "It was fierce, desperate, wordless – a physical reclaiming after lifetimes spent adrift."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Months of agonized separation dissolved in that fierce pressure, the sheer, undeniable *reality* of her warmth against him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The intensity of her embrace, the desperate grip of her fingers digging into the seams of his armor, momentarily shattered the dark weight crushing Geralt’s chest."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He felt Mika’s heartbeat hammering against his own, a frantic counterpoint to the fading hum of the Star Needle applicator."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "But as the initial wave of euphoria receded, the horror flooded back – the temporal storm tearing through his grasp, the faces of his soldiers vanishing into the rip, the crushing certainty of *failure*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He pulled back slightly, just enough to see Mika’s tear-streaked face gazing up at him, radiant with relief."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His own face twisted."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Mika... the Legion...\" he choked out, the words thick with anguish."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The Eddy..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I had them..."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I *felt* them... and then... gone."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Torn away."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "I failed them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Again.\" He tried to pull back further, the burden unbearable."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika instantly tightened her grip, her hand flying up to cup his scarred cheek."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"No!\" she commanded, her voice raw but fierce."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Look at me!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Don't!"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Don't you *dare* go back there!\" Her eyes blazed, anchoring him in the present moment, in the press of her body against his."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He stopped, swallowing hard, forcing his gaze to stay locked with hers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The visceral memory of loss battled the undeniable press of her against him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He took a shuddering breath, trying to obey, to stay *here*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "As the internal storm subsided enough for him to truly focus, his gaze shifted past Mika’s shoulder."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He saw Dren standing nearby, alive, whole, staring at him with bewildered eyes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt froze."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Utterly still."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His breath caught."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He stared, comprehension dawning slowly, impossibly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He looked back at Mika, his brow furrowed in profound confusion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She understood instantly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A slow, compassionate smile touched her lips, fierce pride mixing with shared sorrow."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"You saved them, Geralt,\" she said softly, her voice thick with emotion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Her hand slid down to grip his armored forearm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"You fought the storm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "You held the door open... long enough."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "And *we*,\" she gestured slightly towards the gathered warriors, \"we pulled them back."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Through the bleed."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Your fury tore the scar, but your strength held the path."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Hers pulled them through."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Together."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Your fight, my anchor.\" Dren stepped forward hesitantly."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Commander?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Sir... we felt you."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Pushing us out... before the door slammed shut.\" Understanding washed over Geralt in a wave – the agonizing push he’d made, the despair of letting go... and Mika intercepting, pulling them from the brink."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Failure and salvation intertwined."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He looked from Dren back to Mika, the crushing weight lifting, replaced by a staggering awe."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He pulled Mika fiercely back into his arms, burying his face in her neck, no words needed, just the shared, shuddering breath of impossible reunion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Relief, profound exhaustion, and a burgeoning, fierce joy vibrated between them."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The army remained hushed, bearing witness to the quiet storm of their leaders' embrace."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He held her tighter still, the tremor in his arms easing only slightly as the truth settled deep within his bones."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Months of battling temporal chaos, forcing his way through impossible voids, moments bleeding into centuries – all compressed into the unrelenting pressure of maintaining his grip on that collapsing Eddy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The sheer exhaustion crashed over him now, a physical weight dragging at his limbs, but it was drowned out by the undeniable heat of Mika against him, the scent of her sweat and ozone anchoring him firmly in *now*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He lifted his head just enough to see her face again, her eyes shining with unshed tears and fierce triumph."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Together,\" he rasped, the single word echoing the core tenet that had driven him through the storm."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His gaze swept past her shoulder once more, taking in the assembled warriors – faces he’d mourned, soldiers whose absence had carved a canyon through his spirit."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They stood solid."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Real."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Their presence wasn't just a miracle; it was a testament to the bond Mika spoke of."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "His desperate push, her unwavering pull."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A choked sound escaped him, half-laugh, half-sob."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He pressed his forehead to hers, the dragon armor humming softly against her skin, resonating with the profound relief vibrating through him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The Echo Tower corridor faded, the harsh light softening around the undeniable reality he held."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The silence stretched, profound but comfortable, heavy with shared understanding and unspoken grief transmuting into shared strength."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt finally loosened his grasp slightly, though he kept Mika firmly within the circle of his arms, his hand resting possessively on the small of her back."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He looked towards Oreck, whose impassive lenses betrayed nothing, yet conveyed volumes."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "A nod passed between them – acknowledgment, respect, shared burden."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt's gaze then swept across the ranks, meeting the eyes of soldiers he had led into oblivion and Mika had dragged back into existence."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He saw their confusion still, the lingering horror of non-being, but also a dawning certainty."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They were *here*."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Because he hadn't yielded completely, and because she hadn't stopped believing."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The impossible had been achieved."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Not by one, but by two wills fused in purpose across the fractured timelines."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The air still hummed faintly with the Tower’s psychic residue, but it was overshadowed by the tangible pulse of two hundred and fifty hearts beating strong."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt straightened his shoulders, the weariness still present but now channeled into a renewed resolve."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He met Mika’s eyes again, a flicker of the old fire returning to his own."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"The Sage?\" he asked, his voice steadier now, grounding them both in the next step."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Mika nodded, her eyes reflecting his resolve."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She didn't pull away entirely, her hand resting firmly on his armored chest plate."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Ahead,\" she confirmed, her voice regaining its Commander's edge, yet softened by the lingering intimacy of their reunion."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "She gestured towards the corridor leading deeper into the Tower."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Answers."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Maybe... a way.\" Her gaze held his, acknowledging the unspoken hope – the possibility woven into Zypher's promise and the Sage's ancient knowledge."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "They stood united, commanders once more, the shared trauma of loss and retrieval forging an unbreakable bond."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The army shifted behind them, boots scraping on salt-crusted stone, ready to follow wherever they led."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "Geralt inhaled deeply, the air tasting of ozone, ancient stone, and the faint, metallic tang of temporal energy."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "He squeezed Mika’s shoulder once, a silent affirmation, then turned his gaze towards the shadowed passage."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "\"Then we go,\" he stated, stepping forward, Mika falling naturally into step beside him."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The echoes of their desperate struggle faded behind them as they moved as one towards the heart of the Tower and the mysteries it held."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "The collective breath of the Legion released, a low sigh of anticipation mingling with the soft tramp of boots echoing into the obsidian depths."
    },
    {
      "kind": "narrate",
      "text": "End of chapter 35"
    }
  ],
  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Chapter 35 The highland giants"
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The processor core lay paralysed on the ground."
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She grabbed Dren’s arm—icy cold, trembling."
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Look at me, Dren!"
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You’re here! *Now!*\" Aldrin seized Judson, shouting names, grounding them in the present."
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Soldiers locked eyes with comrades they’d mourned, shouting reassurances, anchoring them in shared reality."
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The vibrating hum subsided."
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The phantom dunes faded."
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Two hundred and fifty warriors stood solid, bewildered, but *real*, blinking in the harsh noon light."
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The flats were silent except for ragged breaths."
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Tower loomed closer, its impossible shadow stretching long across the fractured salt."
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika met Oreck’s impassive lenses."
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Geralt?\" she demanded."
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck shook his head."
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their was a silence that overwhelmed the crowd.. 500 soldiers to tribute Geralt sacrifice Oreck spoke \"Deeper.."
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Sage… awaits.\" And the army continued its march to the Tower."
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck fell into step beside Mika, his voice low."
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They didn’t arrive *with* us, Mika."
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They bled *into* us."
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "From *when*?"
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "From *where*?\" He gestured at the Tower."
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"That place bends time."
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt… he went *back*."
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To save them.\" Mika frowned, struggling with the concept."
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"But they’re here."
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Saved."
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "So why isn’t *he*?\" She recalled the fleeting glimpse in the bleed – Geralt, straining against impossible currents, his face etched with despair."
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"I saw him, Oreck."
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "In the… the distortion."
    },
    {
      "line": 32,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He was fighting, pouring everything out."
    },
    {
      "line": 33,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then… nothing."
    },
    {
      "line": 34,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He didn’t come through.\" The implication hung heavy between them."
    },
    {
      "line": 35,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "If the warriors were ripped from oblivion back to *now*, but Geralt remained lost… Mika’s voice dropped to a whisper."
    },
    {
      "line": 36,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"He succeeded… but failed himself?\""
    },
    {
      "line": 38,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Tower’s entrance yawned before them – a jagged tear in seamless obsidian."
    },
    {
      "line": 39,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika halted the column."
    },
    {
      "line": 40,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Hold!\" Her command echoed strangely."
    },
    {
      "line": 41,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She scanned the warriors, their faces shifting between confusion and dawning horror."
    },
    {
      "line": 42,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They remembered dying."
    },
    {
      "line": 43,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They remembered *not* existing."
    },
    {
      "line": 44,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And now… they remembered Geralt’s agonised face as he hurled himself into the temporal storm *for them*."
    },
    {
      "line": 45,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One soldier, face pale beneath desert grime, stepped forward."
    },
    {
      "line": 46,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Commander Mika?"
    },
    {
      "line": 47,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sir… Geralt… he *pushed* us out."
    },
    {
      "line": 48,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "At the end."
    },
    {
      "line": 49,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We felt it."
    },
    {
      "line": 50,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Like… like being shoved through a closing door.\" His voice cracked."
    },
    {
      "line": 51,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"He stayed behind."
    },
    {
      "line": 52,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Holding it open.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 54,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika stared at the Tower’s dark maw."
    },
    {
      "line": 55,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt wasn’t lost."
    },
    {
      "line": 56,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He was trapped."
    },
    {
      "line": 57,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sacrificed."
    },
    {
      "line": 58,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Sage awaited."
    },
    {
      "line": 59,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "So did answers."
    },
    {
      "line": 60,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And maybe, just maybe, a way back."
    },
    {
      "line": 61,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She squared her shoulders, her voice cutting through the stunned silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 62,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Then we go *in*."
    },
    {
      "line": 63,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We find him."
    },
    {
      "line": 64,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We bring him home.\" She strode forward, the army surging behind her, their footsteps echoing into the shadowed throat of the Echo Tower."
    },
    {
      "line": 65,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air shimmered faintly, tasting of ozone and regret."
    },
    {
      "line": 67,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck matched her stride, his lenses whirring softly."
    },
    {
      "line": 68,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He saw the fierce hope blazing in her eyes, the desperate certainty that Geralt was *here*, trapped within these obsidian walls."
    },
    {
      "line": 69,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Mika,\" he said, his voice low and urgent, cutting through the tramp of boots."
    },
    {
      "line": 70,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Listen."
    },
    {
      "line": 71,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "What you saw in the bleed..."
    },
    {
      "line": 72,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt wasn't *here*."
    },
    {
      "line": 73,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He wasn't bleeding *into* this Tower.\" He gestured sharply at the dark entrance swallowing them."
    },
    {
      "line": 74,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"This isn't the source."
    },
    {
      "line": 75,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This isn't the passage *to* him.\" His lenses locked onto hers."
    },
    {
      "line": 76,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"This is the Echo Tower."
    },
    {
      "line": 77,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Where Zypher took Geralts five loyal followers after finding their body's at the crash site."
    },
    {
      "line": 78,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We came *here*, Mika, hoping Geralt had somehow came here too, after his crash."
    },
    {
      "line": 79,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But after what you witnessed... him straining against the temporal currents, pouring himself out *there*...\" Oreck paused, the hum of the Tower vibratingthrough their boots."
    },
    {
      "line": 80,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"I don't want you to get your hopes up."
    },
    {
      "line": 81,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He might be anywhere."
    },
    {
      "line": 82,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Or any*when*."
    },
    {
      "line": 83,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But not necessarily *here*.\"."
    },
    {
      "line": 84,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"I don't want you to get your hopes up."
    },
    {
      "line": 86,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The corridor inside was impossibly vast, walls curving upward into darkness."
    },
    {
      "line": 87,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air grew colder, thick with the scent of ancient stone and something metallic."
    },
    {
      "line": 88,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Phantom whispers seemed to brush past their ears – fragments of conversations long silenced."
    },
    {
      "line": 89,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika kept walking, her jaw tight."
    },
    {
      "line": 90,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck's words landed like stones."
    },
    {
      "line": 91,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Echo Tower."
    },
    {
      "line": 92,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zypher's folly."
    },
    {
      "line": 93,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not Geralt's destination."
    },
    {
      "line": 94,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Just a desperate gamble."
    },
    {
      "line": 95,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Yet, the Sage resided here."
    },
    {
      "line": 96,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Knowledge resided here."
    },
    {
      "line": 97,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She glanced back at the soldiers, their faces etched with the shared trauma of non-existence and Geralt's sacrifice."
    },
    {
      "line": 98,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their presence was his final act."
    },
    {
      "line": 99,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Hope isn't a weakness, Oreck,\" she stated, her voice echoing strangely in the cavernous hall."
    },
    {
      "line": 100,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It's fuel."
    },
    {
      "line": 101,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We find the Sage."
    },
    {
      "line": 102,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And hopefully some answers.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 104,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The deeper they went, the stranger the echoes became."
    },
    {
      "line": 105,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Footsteps multiplied into a phantom army marching unseen."
    },
    {
      "line": 106,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Voices fractured into overlapping whispers, snippets of Mika's own thoughts bouncing back: *\"...anywhen...\" \"...trapped...\" \"...bring him...\"*."
    },
    {
      "line": 107,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "At a junction, she saw flickers – ghostly outlines of themselves moving down branching corridors moments before they did."
    },
    {
      "line": 108,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Ignore the echoes,\" Mika commanded, her voice firm despite the unnerving feedback."
    },
    {
      "line": 109,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Focus forward."
    },
    {
      "line": 110,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Sage's chamber.\" The Tower seemed designed to unravel sanity, reflecting doubt and fear back at its intruders."
    },
    {
      "line": 112,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The corridor abruptly ended at a circular chamber."
    },
    {
      "line": 113,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Utterly bare."
    },
    {
      "line": 114,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Utterly silent."
    },
    {
      "line": 115,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No Sage."
    },
    {
      "line": 116,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No artifacts."
    },
    {
      "line": 117,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only a single, immense mirror dominating the far wall."
    },
    {
      "line": 118,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its surface was liquid obsidian, swirling with impossible depth."
    },
    {
      "line": 119,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika approached cautiously."
    },
    {
      "line": 120,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her reflection didn't appear."
    },
    {
      "line": 121,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Instead, the mirror revealed a desolate courtyard under a bruised sky."
    },
    {
      "line": 122,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Five arched doorways stood open around its perimeter, dark mouths leading deeper into shadow."
    },
    {
      "line": 123,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Standing calmly in the courtyard’s center, gazing directly *through* the mirror at Mika, was Zypher."
    },
    {
      "line": 124,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His expression was unreadable, a flicker of something like weary resignation in his eyes."
    },
    {
      "line": 125,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He wasn't trapped; he was waiting."
    },
    {
      "line": 126,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He gestured slowly towards the five open chambers."
    },
    {
      "line": 127,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika knew without seeing: Geralt's five loyal followers lay within."
    },
    {
      "line": 128,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This was the Echo's heart – a gateway, not a destination."
    },
    {
      "line": 130,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika met Zypher's gaze through the impossible glass."
    },
    {
      "line": 131,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Where is he?\" Her voice, amplified by the chamber, boomed like thunder."
    },
    {
      "line": 132,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zypher didn't flinch."
    },
    {
      "line": 133,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He simply pointed upwards, towards the bruised sky in the mirrored courtyard."
    },
    {
      "line": 134,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not towards chambers holding bodies, but towards the roiling heavens themselves."
    },
    {
      "line": 135,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The implication was chillingly clear: Geralt wasn't trapped in a room."
    },
    {
      "line": 136,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He was trapped *in the storm*."
    },
    {
      "line": 137,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck hissed beside her, lenses clicking furiously."
    },
    {
      "line": 138,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The temporal currents..."
    },
    {
      "line": 139,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He's *holding* the door open."
    },
    {
      "line": 140,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Still."
    },
    {
      "line": 141,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "From *then*.\" Mika stared at the sky beyond Zypher, her hope hardening into cold resolve."
    },
    {
      "line": 142,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Then we go *there*.\" She raised her hand towards the mirror's surface."
    },
    {
      "line": 144,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It yielded like cold, thick oil."
    },
    {
      "line": 145,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika plunged through, followed instantly by Oreck, Dren, and the wiry scout, Kael."
    },
    {
      "line": 146,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Behind them, the army watched, frozen, as the mirror swallowed their commanders."
    },
    {
      "line": 147,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The transition was instantaneous."
    },
    {
      "line": 148,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One moment, the sterile obsidian chamber; the next, the desolate courtyard under that bruised, turbulent sky."
    },
    {
      "line": 149,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air crackled with latent energy, humming against Mika's teeth."
    },
    {
      "line": 150,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zypher stood before them, calm as deep water."
    },
    {
      "line": 151,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He inclined his head slightly."
    },
    {
      "line": 152,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Commander Mika."
    },
    {
      "line": 153,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck.\" His eyes lingered on Dren, a flicker of recognition – or perhaps sorrow – before settling back on Mika."
    },
    {
      "line": 154,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"You demand explanation."
    },
    {
      "line": 155,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Suffice it to say, Geralt is my friend."
    },
    {
      "line": 156,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I commune with the Aeon Keepers through the Nephrati."
    },
    {
      "line": 157,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They foresaw Geralt's strength."
    },
    {
      "line": 158,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I was there when the Council gifted him the armor.\" His voice was low, resonant, carrying effortlessly over the ambient hum."
    },
    {
      "line": 159,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Finding his five loyal followers confirmed what I feared: Geralt wasn't with them."
    },
    {
      "line": 160,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He'd already sacrificed himself to the temporal breach."
    },
    {
      "line": 161,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "So I saved what I could."
    },
    {
      "line": 162,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I brought them *here*.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 164,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He gestured towards the five open doorways."
    },
    {
      "line": 165,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Within the shadows, Mika could just discern still forms lying on biers of shimmering energy."
    },
    {
      "line": 166,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The Echo Chamber facilitates resurrection,\" Zypher continued."
    },
    {
      "line": 167,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"But it demands choice."
    },
    {
      "line": 168,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They battle oblivion now, deciding whether to return."
    },
    {
      "line": 169,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "If they choose life, they will emerge... themselves."
    },
    {
      "line": 170,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Wholly."
    },
    {
      "line": 171,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Loyal to Geralt unto death, just as they were."
    },
    {
      "line": 172,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt himself?"
    },
    {
      "line": 173,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He hasn't passed."
    },
    {
      "line": 174,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I cannot verify it, but I *know* it."
    },
    {
      "line": 175,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He endures."
    },
    {
      "line": 176,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And I expect him to find his own way back.\" Zypher's gaze swept over Mika, Oreck, Dren, and Kael."
    },
    {
      "line": 177,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Your army is free to depart or stay."
    },
    {
      "line": 178,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They are welcome here."
    },
    {
      "line": 179,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But Geralt... he will come."
    },
    {
      "line": 180,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He always finds the path.\" His eyes returned to the writhing sky."
    },
    {
      "line": 181,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Even if he must forge it himself.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 183,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "+++++++++++++++++"
    },
    {
      "line": 185,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As he climbed the crater’s northern rim, leaving the fused glass behind, the harsh ochre sands returned."
    },
    {
      "line": 186,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Edge of the World Chasm loomed ahead, a monstrous gash splitting the Scorch, its depths lost in perpetual shadow."
    },
    {
      "line": 187,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt paused on the precipice, the wind whipping his scarf, tasting of dust and the void below."
    },
    {
      "line": 188,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Movement caught his eye – not Chronohounds, but forms emerging from the dunes below the chasm’s lip."
    },
    {
      "line": 189,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Massive bodies, Tufts of fur the color of dried blood and burnt sand, a visual scar of how harsh this terrain was to endure living in, lumbered into view. *Dregans*."
    },
    {
      "line": 190,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Desert predators."
    },
    {
      "line": 191,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each stood thrice his height, their powerful hind legs built for bounding leaps, their forelimbs ending in shovel-like claws for digging."
    },
    {
      "line": 192,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Useless, leathery wings, too small for flight, flapped agitatedly against their flanks."
    },
    {
      "line": 193,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Deadliest of all were the thick, muscular tails, tipped with a crushing, bony grip capable of pulverizing stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 194,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A pack."
    },
    {
      "line": 195,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ten, maybe twelve."
    },
    {
      "line": 196,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Normally, they’d scent prey instantly – a lone human was easy meat."
    },
    {
      "line": 197,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt tensed, hand instinctively going to his blade hilt."
    },
    {
      "line": 198,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This many would be overwhelming."
    },
    {
      "line": 200,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They didn’t charge."
    },
    {
      "line": 201,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They simply… lined up."
    },
    {
      "line": 202,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Formed a rough corridor leading away from the Heart’s crater, towards the faint, treacherous path skirting the chasm’s edge."
    },
    {
      "line": 203,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their obsidian eyes, like chips of volcanic glass, fixed not on him as prey, but *through* him, towards the scarred depression he’d just climbed from."
    },
    {
      "line": 204,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their nostrils flared, tasting the lingering psychic residue – the shared grief, the acknowledged pain."
    },
    {
      "line": 205,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One, a massive elder with cracked horns, lowered its head slightly."
    },
    {
      "line": 206,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A low, rumbling groan vibrated through the sand beneath Geralt’s boots, not aggressive, but resonant."
    },
    {
      "line": 207,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It echoed the Heart’s weary thrum."
    },
    {
      "line": 208,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The applicator remained silent; no threat detected."
    },
    {
      "line": 209,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dragon armor hummed softly, echoing Zaron’s shared sorrow."
    },
    {
      "line": 211,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron waited in the silence for a few heartbeats, his spirit woven into the armor's core, until the Dregans' psychic imprint could no longer be felt resonating in the sand beneath Geralt’s feet."
    },
    {
      "line": 212,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only then did the ancient dragon acknowledge their actions with a surge of grim respect through the armor’s neural link. *\"That silent hum,\"* Zaron’s voice resonated within Geralt’s mind, sharp as obsidian shards, *\"is not traditional Dregan behavior."
    },
    {
      "line": 213,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They are predators by nature."
    },
    {
      "line": 214,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They screech like sirens."
    },
    {
      "line": 215,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The sound alone once shattered Giant's Rock into brittle glass that powdered in the wind."
    },
    {
      "line": 216,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence… speaks of recognition."
    },
    {
      "line": 217,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Or mourning.\"* The implication hung heavy."
    },
    {
      "line": 218,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Dregans, ancient denizens of the Scorch, perhaps sensed the shared burden Geralt had carried from the Heart."
    },
    {
      "line": 219,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They offered passage, not attack."
    },
    {
      "line": 221,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The path northward shifted dramatically."
    },
    {
      "line": 222,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The choking dunes gave way to rocky plateaus, the air cooling as elevation climbed."
    },
    {
      "line": 223,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Snow-capped peaks loomed in the distance—the first fingers of the Crescent Mountains."
    },
    {
      "line": 224,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Scrubby trees, twisted but alive, dotted the landscape where groundwater seeped up through fractured stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 225,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sand yielded to gravel, then to packed earth strewn with hardy alpine grasses."
    },
    {
      "line": 226,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The oppressive heat lifted, replaced by a wind carrying the scent of pine and distant ice."
    },
    {
      "line": 227,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt crested a ridge, muscles burning from the climb but lungs grateful for the cleaner air."
    },
    {
      "line": 228,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Below, nestled in a sheltered valley bowl beside a rushing glacial stream, stood a small encampment."
    },
    {
      "line": 229,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sturdy hide tents clustered around a central fire pit."
    },
    {
      "line": 230,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sharpened stakes formed a defensive perimeter—overkill for such a remote location."
    },
    {
      "line": 231,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt counted eight figures moving with military precision among the tents."
    },
    {
      "line": 232,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "All wore patched leathers, but their movements spoke of Legion training."
    },
    {
      "line": 234,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As Geralt descended the slope, every head turned."
    },
    {
      "line": 235,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Weapons didn’t rise, but hands drifted towards blades and spear shafts."
    },
    {
      "line": 236,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Postures shifted subtly—ready, assessing."
    },
    {
      "line": 237,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He kept his own hands visible, away from his sword."
    },
    {
      "line": 238,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Star Needle emblem pulsed faintly on his vambrace."
    },
    {
      "line": 239,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "By the time he reached the perimeter stakes, only two figures remained visible outside the tents—a broad-shouldered man sharpening a spearhead, and a woman with grey streaking her dark braids, tending the fire."
    },
    {
      "line": 240,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The others had melted into the shadows, watchful ghosts."
    },
    {
      "line": 241,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt stopped ten paces out."
    },
    {
      "line": 243,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The woman at the fire straightened slowly, wiping ash-stained hands on her leggings."
    },
    {
      "line": 244,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her eyes, sharp and wary beneath scarred brows, locked onto Geralt’s face."
    },
    {
      "line": 245,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then flickered to the dragon armor, gleaming dully in the thin mountain light."
    },
    {
      "line": 246,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Distrust warred with dawning recognition."
    },
    {
      "line": 247,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A lifetime of shared suffering vibrated in the silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 249,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Commander?\""
    },
    {
      "line": 250,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her voice was rough, disbelieving. The man sharpening the spear froze mid-stroke."
    },
    {
      "line": 252,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt nodded once."
    },
    {
      "line": 253,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Sella.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 255,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A choked sound escaped her."
    },
    {
      "line": 256,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The spear dropped from the man’s hands with a clatter."
    },
    {
      "line": 257,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He surged forward, disbelief melting into fierce joy."
    },
    {
      "line": 258,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Geralt!"
    },
    {
      "line": 259,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "By the shattered chains!\" He grabbed Geralt’s forearm in the old Legion grip—forearm to forearm, a grip forged in the slave pits before they had names."
    },
    {
      "line": 260,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The woman, Sella, joined them, her calloused hand gripping Geralt’s other shoulder with bruising intensity."
    },
    {
      "line": 261,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her eyes scanned the armor again, lingering on the subtle dragon-scale pattern fused into the pauldron."
    },
    {
      "line": 262,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"We know the feel of that power,\" she rasped."
    },
    {
      "line": 263,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It whispers of old masters."
    },
    {
      "line": 264,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But *you*...\" Her grip tightened."
    },
    {
      "line": 265,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"You broke our collars on the Bloodstone Fields."
    },
    {
      "line": 266,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Fought beside us when the sky fell.\" The memory—desperate charges against Anunnaki overseers, the roar of breaking chains—hung thick between them."
    },
    {
      "line": 267,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Trust wasn't given lightly here."
    },
    {
      "line": 268,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was earned in blood and shared defiance."
    },
    {
      "line": 269,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They trusted *him*, armor or not."
    },
    {
      "line": 270,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The shadows stirred as others emerged cautiously, drawn by the raw emotion resonating from their leader’s reunion."
    },
    {
      "line": 272,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The camp was spare but efficient."
    },
    {
      "line": 273,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Smoked meat hung near the fire pit; sharpened stakes ringed the tents."
    },
    {
      "line": 274,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sella gestured Geralt towards a hide stool near the flames."
    },
    {
      "line": 275,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Found this cleft months back,\" she explained, pouring bitter kaff from a dented pot."
    },
    {
      "line": 276,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Good water."
    },
    {
      "line": 277,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Few predators big enough to threaten us.\" She nodded towards the peaks looming above."
    },
    {
      "line": 278,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The Giants pass higher."
    },
    {
      "line": 279,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We stay low.\" Geralt noted the tension coiled beneath her calm."
    },
    {
      "line": 280,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Hunted?\" Sella’s eyes hardened."
    },
    {
      "line": 281,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Not beasts."
    },
    {
      "line": 282,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Raiders."
    },
    {
      "line": 283,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "From the lowlands."
    },
    {
      "line": 284,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They sniffed us out last moon-cycle."
    },
    {
      "line": 285,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Took two.\" She spat into the fire."
    },
    {
      "line": 286,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"We retrieved one."
    },
    {
      "line": 287,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Buried him yesterday.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 289,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A lean scout named Jorik leaned forward, his gaze sharp."
    },
    {
      "line": 290,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"You heading deeper, Commander?"
    },
    {
      "line": 291,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Towards the giants?\" Geralt nodded, sipping the harsh brew."
    },
    {
      "line": 292,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Star Needle resonance was a constant pull northward."
    },
    {
      "line": 293,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sella exchanged a weighted glance with the others."
    },
    {
      "line": 294,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The Giants,\" she said slowly, \"they don't come down."
    },
    {
      "line": 295,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Don't want visitors."
    },
    {
      "line": 296,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They see...\" she tapped her temple, \"...*knowledge*."
    },
    {
      "line": 297,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Strength of mind, not blade."
    },
    {
      "line": 298,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They know what this armor is.\" She paused, her voice dropping."
    },
    {
      "line": 299,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They know *where* it came from.\" The applicator hummed softly in Geralt’s mind, confirming her words with fragmented data: *Highland Giants: Isolationist."
    },
    {
      "line": 300,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cognitive Ascendancy culture."
    },
    {
      "line": 301,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Primary archive: Annunaki pre-collapse…*"
    },
    {
      "line": 303,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"They won't welcome you,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 304,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik warned. \"Not wearing that. They see it... as stolen fire.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 306,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt set his cup down."
    },
    {
      "line": 307,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dragon armor pulsed faintly, reacting to the mountain’s proximity and the Giants’ unseen gaze."
    },
    {
      "line": 308,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"I need their knowledge,\" he stated flatly."
    },
    {
      "line": 309,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The Needle Spires."
    },
    {
      "line": 310,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Accessing the Akashic records.\" A ripple of surprise went through the small group."
    },
    {
      "line": 311,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sella stared at him."
    },
    {
      "line": 312,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The Spires?"
    },
    {
      "line": 313,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They're... buried."
    },
    {
      "line": 314,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Lost.\" Geralt met her gaze."
    },
    {
      "line": 315,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"One isn't."
    },
    {
      "line": 316,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Buried, yes."
    },
    {
      "line": 317,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But not lost."
    },
    {
      "line": 318,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Giants guard it."
    },
    {
      "line": 319,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I need to configure it.\" He felt the applicator stir, analyzing pathways."
    },
    {
      "line": 320,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"To find an army.\" Silence fell, thick with unspoken questions and the crackle of the fire."
    },
    {
      "line": 321,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sella leaned back, her scarred face thoughtful in the flickering light."
    },
    {
      "line": 322,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The path is treacherous,\" she finally said."
    },
    {
      "line": 323,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The Giants watch."
    },
    {
      "line": 324,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And worse things crawl near their peaks.\" She glanced at her companions, a silent agreement passing between them."
    },
    {
      "line": 325,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"We know the lower slopes."
    },
    {
      "line": 326,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We'll take you as far as the Whispering Stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 327,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Beyond that...\" She shrugged."
    },
    {
      "line": 328,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"You face the Giants alone.\" The offer was simple, born of loyalty forged in chains."
    },
    {
      "line": 329,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt inclined his head."
    },
    {
      "line": 330,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Thank you, Sella.\" Tomorrow, the ascent would begin."
    },
    {
      "line": 331,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The mountain waited."
    },
    {
      "line": 333,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The scout, Jorik, stepped forward quietly."
    },
    {
      "line": 334,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He wasn't imposing like the others, wiry and sharp-eyed."
    },
    {
      "line": 335,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Without a word, he untied a long, dark bundle from his back."
    },
    {
      "line": 336,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Unwrapping cured hides, he revealed a weapon unlike any Geralt had seen: a bow taller than Jorik himself, crafted from layers of horn and sinew laminated onto a core of dark, resilient wood."
    },
    {
      "line": 337,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It gleamed faintly under the firelight."
    },
    {
      "line": 338,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Found the wood higher up,\" Jorik muttered, his voice rough."
    },
    {
      "line": 339,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Near a place where the Giants left offerings."
    },
    {
      "line": 340,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Horn from a mountain beast that tried to eat me.\" He strung it with startling ease, the thick sinew singing taut."
    },
    {
      "line": 341,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"No metal."
    },
    {
      "line": 342,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No pulleys."
    },
    {
      "line": 343,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Just... leverage.\" He handed Geralt an arrow – thick shaft, obsidian head shaped like a leaf."
    },
    {
      "line": 344,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Draws heavier than any Legion bow."
    },
    {
      "line": 345,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shoots farther.\" Geralt hefted the arrow."
    },
    {
      "line": 346,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The craftsmanship was primal, lethal."
    },
    {
      "line": 347,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"First of its kind?\" Jorik nodded curtly."
    },
    {
      "line": 348,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Call it necessity."
    },
    {
      "line": 349,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Raiders shoot farther.\" Geralt sensed the raw potential."
    },
    {
      "line": 350,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"You climb with me.\" It wasn't a question."
    },
    {
      "line": 351,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik hesitated, glancing at Sella."
    },
    {
      "line": 352,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She gave a single, sharp nod."
    },
    {
      "line": 353,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"To the Stone,\" she confirmed."
    },
    {
      "line": 354,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The scout met Geralt's gaze, a flicker of unease beneath his resolve."
    },
    {
      "line": 355,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Beyond the Stone... the Giants *see*."
    },
    {
      "line": 356,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They feel trespass.\" Geralt understood the fear."
    },
    {
      "line": 357,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"We face it together.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 359,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The night passed under a canopy of icy stars."
    },
    {
      "line": 360,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The fire burned low."
    },
    {
      "line": 361,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sentries watched the perimeter."
    },
    {
      "line": 362,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt sat apart, not sleeping, feeling the pull of the Star Needle Spire resonate deep within him."
    },
    {
      "line": 363,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He sensed a different watchfulness too – ancient, damp."
    },
    {
      "line": 364,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not hostile, but alien."
    },
    {
      "line": 365,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "From the distant swamps clinging to the mountain's lower flanks, he felt unseen eyes."
    },
    {
      "line": 366,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The applicator confirmed it: *Psychic signatures detected: Pattern: 'Neferati'."
    },
    {
      "line": 367,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Classification: Aeon-Keeper thought-form manifestations.* They were observing, flowing through the mist like sentient shadows."
    },
    {
      "line": 368,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their presence was a low hum beneath the mountain's chroniton thrum."
    },
    {
      "line": 369,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They knew him."
    },
    {
      "line": 370,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They knew the armor."
    },
    {
      "line": 371,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were the silent architects who had subtly guided him towards the Aeon Keepers long ago, weaving possibilities."
    },
    {
      "line": 372,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They wouldn't climb with him."
    },
    {
      "line": 373,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their help was whispers on the wind, influencing perception, easing the Giants' hostility from afar."
    },
    {
      "line": 374,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt acknowledged their unseen gaze."
    },
    {
      "line": 375,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Allies of necessity, bound by secrets older than nations."
    },
    {
      "line": 376,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His thoughts drifted northward, beyond the peaks, to Mika."
    },
    {
      "line": 377,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Soon."
    },
    {
      "line": 378,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He clenched his fist, the dragon scale gauntlet gleaming coldly. *Soon.*"
    },
    {
      "line": 380,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The predawn light painted the peaks in shades of bone and ash."
    },
    {
      "line": 381,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt stood ready beside Jorik."
    },
    {
      "line": 382,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The scout wore layered furs, his longbow slung and a quiver of heavy arrows on his back."
    },
    {
      "line": 383,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His jaw was set tight."
    },
    {
      "line": 384,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sella clasped Geralt's forearm once more."
    },
    {
      "line": 385,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Safe passage, Commander."
    },
    {
      "line": 386,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Find your army.\" She nodded curtly at Jorik."
    },
    {
      "line": 387,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Watch his back.\" The ascent began immediately, steep and silent."
    },
    {
      "line": 388,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air grew thinner, sharper."
    },
    {
      "line": 389,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They traversed scree slopes and knife-edge ridges."
    },
    {
      "line": 390,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik moved with uncanny silence, his eyes constantly scanning the rocks above."
    },
    {
      "line": 391,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt felt the Giants' gaze intensify – a chilling pressure, like glaciers grinding against his mind."
    },
    {
      "line": 392,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It wasn't anger, but profound disinterest bordering on disdain."
    },
    {
      "line": 393,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They saw the armor, the applicator, the stolen fire."
    },
    {
      "line": 394,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They saw a trespasser."
    },
    {
      "line": 395,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Neferati's subtle influence felt like thin oil on turbulent water, barely holding the Giants' outright rejection at bay."
    },
    {
      "line": 396,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As they approached a massive, weathered monolith etched with faint, swirling symbols – the Whispering Stone – Jorik stopped."
    },
    {
      "line": 397,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"This is it,\" he breathed, unease thick in his voice."
    },
    {
      "line": 398,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Stone hummed faintly, resonating with the mountain's disapproval."
    },
    {
      "line": 399,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Beyond it, the path vanished into sheer cliffs and swirling mist."
    },
    {
      "line": 400,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik looked at Geralt, conflict stark in his eyes."
    },
    {
      "line": 401,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Commander... beyond here...\" His hand tightened on his bow."
    },
    {
      "line": 403,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt faced him squarely."
    },
    {
      "line": 404,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The Spire isn't just *my* path, Jorik. its where i find my answers, Where the Harbinger filed the Five.\" Geralt gestured towards the mist-shrouded peaks, doubt for the first time crossed his mind.. what does any of thos have to do with Mika?"
    },
    {
      "line": 405,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She was by the crashsite and not seen from since then..."
    },
    {
      "line": 406,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And the five.. they were on that ship with me when it crashed.. when did they get filed away?"
    },
    {
      "line": 407,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shaking the thoughts away he continued."
    },
    {
      "line": 408,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Knowledge buried there can break chains far heavier than ours."
    },
    {
      "line": 409,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Knowledge the Giants hoard, while others suffer, but giants in general.. they are stewards of this land.. at all costs we need them on our side as much as they will need us\" He tapped the Star Needle emblem on his vambrace."
    },
    {
      "line": 410,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"This resonance pulls north."
    },
    {
      "line": 411,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It’s our compass."
    },
    {
      "line": 412,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Yours feels it too, deeper than fear."
    },
    {
      "line": 413,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Trust that.\" Jorik stared at the mist, then down at his bow."
    },
    {
      "line": 414,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He remembered the raiders, the stolen Legionaries, the helplessness."
    },
    {
      "line": 415,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He remembered crafting this weapon from necessity."
    },
    {
      "line": 416,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His jaw clenched."
    },
    {
      "line": 417,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They'll see us,\" he muttered, not looking at Geralt."
    },
    {
      "line": 418,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"They'll feel us climbing.\" \"Then let them see determination,\" Geralt countered softly."
    },
    {
      "line": 419,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"And let them add humanity to the first page in their archives.\" Jorik met Geralt’s gaze."
    },
    {
      "line": 420,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The fear didn't vanish, but resolve hardened beneath it."
    },
    {
      "line": 421,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He gave a single, sharp nod, adjusted his quiver, and stepped deliberately past the Whispering Stone into the mist."
    },
    {
      "line": 422,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The mountain's disapproval sharpened instantly, a psychic wind threatening to push them back."
    },
    {
      "line": 424,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"Ice Drakes\""
    },
    {
      "line": 425,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": ". Faster than thought, Jorik planted his feet on a narrow ledge, nocked an arrow, and drew the massive horn bow in one fluid motion. The sinew groaned. He sighted, exhaled, and released. The arrow blurred, striking the lead drake squarely in the throat. It shrieked, plummeting past them. Before the others could react, Jorik had another arrow nocked, fired, striking the second drake's wing joint. It spiraled away, shrieking. The third hesitated. Geralt drew his blade, but Jorik's third arrow took it through the eye. Silence crashed back, broken only by the wind. Jorik lowered the bow, breathing hard, a savage grin briefly touching his lips. \"Told you it drew heavy,\" he rasped. Geralt stared at the falling shapes. \"Hell of a bowman,\" he acknowledged. They climbed higher. The mist parted briefly, revealing a colossal cave mouth high above – the Giant's threshold. The Giants knew they were coming. They also knew Jorik could shoot. The path narrowed. Mika felt closer than ever."
    },
    {
      "line": 427,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Suddenly, the rock beneath Geralt’s boot dissolved."
    },
    {
      "line": 428,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not crumbled – *flowed*."
    },
    {
      "line": 429,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The ledge liquefied into swirling vapour."
    },
    {
      "line": 430,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He pitched sideways into thin air."
    },
    {
      "line": 431,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik yelled, grabbing futilely."
    },
    {
      "line": 432,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The mountain itself was rejecting them."
    },
    {
      "line": 433,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt plummeted – then slammed onto an invisible platform of solidified mist."
    },
    {
      "line": 434,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It shimmered beneath him, icy cold."
    },
    {
      "line": 435,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Looking up, he saw Jorik frozen mid-reach, suspended on another disc of cloud-stone."
    },
    {
      "line": 436,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Before them, impossibly tall, stood Althurion, First Speaker."
    },
    {
      "line": 437,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His skin held the blue-white sheen of glacial ice, his eyes the pale, infinite expanse of a winter sky."
    },
    {
      "line": 438,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tendrils of cloud wreathed his form."
    },
    {
      "line": 439,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He didn't speak; the harmonics emerged directly from the vibrating air itself, deep and resonant, making Geralt’s bones hum. **\"Trespassers.\"** The word wasn't accusation, merely fact. **\"You wear stolen fire."
    },
    {
      "line": 440,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You climb with violence."
    },
    {
      "line": 441,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You disturb the Aetherhold's song.\"** His gaze, ancient and utterly alien, locked onto Geralt’s armor, then flicked to Jorik’s bow."
    },
    {
      "line": 442,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The mountain’s disapproval solidified into crushing pressure."
    },
    {
      "line": 443,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt felt the Neferati’s subtle influence fraying like old rope."
    },
    {
      "line": 444,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This was raw Giantsong, unmediated."
    },
    {
      "line": 446,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt forced his breathing steady."
    },
    {
      "line": 447,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Panic was death here."
    },
    {
      "line": 448,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He met Althurion’s sky-pale eyes."
    },
    {
      "line": 449,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"We seek not violence, but understanding,\" he called out, voice straining against the harmonic pressure."
    },
    {
      "line": 450,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He gestured to the Star Needle emblem."
    },
    {
      "line": 451,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"This resonance calls us north."
    },
    {
      "line": 452,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not for conquest."
    },
    {
      "line": 453,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To mend what was broken.\" He glanced at Jorik, suspended nearby."
    },
    {
      "line": 454,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The bow defends."
    },
    {
      "line": 455,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It does not initiate."
    },
    {
      "line": 456,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We climb seeking knowledge buried deep – knowledge of the Needle Spire you guard.\" He didn't plead."
    },
    {
      "line": 457,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He stated."
    },
    {
      "line": 458,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He anchored himself in his purpose: Mika, the Five, the scattered Legion."
    },
    {
      "line": 459,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The applicator flared weakly, attempting to map the Giant’s harmonic structure – impossibly complex."
    },
    {
      "line": 460,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Althurion tilted his massive head, studying Geralt."
    },
    {
      "line": 461,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air thrummed with silent assessment."
    },
    {
      "line": 462,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The pressure didn't lessen, but it shifted – less rejection, more profound scrutiny. **\"Understanding?\"** the harmonics resonated, tinged with skepticism colder than the wind. **\"Mortals grasp fragments."
    },
    {
      "line": 463,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They shatter harmonies.\"** His gaze lingered on the armor. **\"This vessel speaks of shattering.\"**"
    },
    {
      "line": 465,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt straightened on the disc of mist."
    },
    {
      "line": 466,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His voice cut through the harmonic hum, sharp with conviction."
    },
    {
      "line": 467,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It speaks of survival."
    },
    {
      "line": 468,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Of defiance against entropy."
    },
    {
      "line": 469,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Against *Xal'Zirith*.\" He projected the name, letting the Harbinger’s psychic stain resonate faintly through his applicator – a discordant counterpoint to the Giantsong."
    },
    {
      "line": 470,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Althurion recoiled microscopically, a ripple passing through his cloud-wisp form. **\"The Devourer’s stain...\"** The harmonics deepened, vibrating with grim recognition. **\"It festers across the skein.\"** He studied Geralt anew, the pale eyes narrowing. **\"You wield stolen fire against the Devourer’s shadow?\"** The question hung, heavy with implication."
    },
    {
      "line": 471,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt met his gaze unflinchingly."
    },
    {
      "line": 472,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"I wield it *because* of the shadow."
    },
    {
      "line": 473,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To pull back what was taken.\" He gestured northward, towards the unseen spire’s pull."
    },
    {
      "line": 474,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The Spire holds answers locked away."
    },
    {
      "line": 475,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Answers the Devourer fears.\" Althurion was silent for a long moment."
    },
    {
      "line": 476,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The mist-platforms solidified further beneath their feet."
    },
    {
      "line": 477,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The crushing pressure eased fractionally, replaced by intense, humming focus. **\"Harmony against discord,\"** the harmonics resonated, softer now. **\"A worthy trial."
    },
    {
      "line": 478,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But understanding…\"** The Giant’s gaze swept over them both, lingering on Jorik’s tense posture, Geralt’s cracked armor. **\"...must be earned.\"** He raised a hand."
    },
    {
      "line": 479,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The path ahead shimmered, revealing not rock, but swirling clouds forming a treacherous bridge deeper into the Aetherhold."
    },
    {
      "line": 480,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The first test awaited."
    },
    {
      "line": 482,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cloud-bridge felt like walking through solidified thought."
    },
    {
      "line": 483,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Each step resonated with harmonics, vibrating up Geralt’s legs and into his core."
    },
    {
      "line": 484,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It demanded balance – not just physical, but intentional."
    },
    {
      "line": 485,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A misstep in focus, a spike of fear from Jorik, and the mist beneath their boots would thin alarmingly."
    },
    {
      "line": 486,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Althurion walked effortlessly ahead, his form blending with the vapour. **\"Intent shapes substance,\"** his harmonics hummed, a lesson woven into the air itself. **\"Anger?"
    },
    {
      "line": 487,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The bridge trembles."
    },
    {
      "line": 488,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Doubt?"
    },
    {
      "line": 489,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It dissolves."
    },
    {
      "line": 490,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Clarity?"
    },
    {
      "line": 491,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It holds.\"** Geralt felt the applicator strain, analyzing the harmonic frequencies, trying to find a stable resonance."
    },
    {
      "line": 492,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was useless."
    },
    {
      "line": 493,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This wasn't logic; it was *will*."
    },
    {
      "line": 494,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He pictured Mika’s determined smile, Varik’s loyalty, the desperate hope of the scattered 250."
    },
    {
      "line": 495,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Purpose solidified."
    },
    {
      "line": 496,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His steps grew firmer."
    },
    {
      "line": 497,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Beside him, Jorik breathed slowly, eyes fixed on Geralt’s back, drawing resolve from him."
    },
    {
      "line": 498,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The bridge steadied."
    },
    {
      "line": 499,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ahead, the mist parted onto a vast, impossible plaza carved from living cloud and gleaming ice-crystal."
    },
    {
      "line": 500,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Structures shimmered into view – libraries formed from frozen lightning, archives held in suspended raindrops."
    },
    {
      "line": 501,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And standing sentinel were more Giants, their frost-pale eyes watching, waiting."
    },
    {
      "line": 503,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Althurion turned, facing them fully on the plaza's edge. **\"You seek the Buried Resonance,\"** he stated, harmonics resonating with the deep thrum of the mountain itself. **\"The Annunaki artifact beneath our peaks."
    },
    {
      "line": 504,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not a trophy."
    },
    {
      "line": 505,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A ward.\"** His gaze pinned Geralt. **\"Its activation risks unleashing what it contains."
    },
    {
      "line": 506,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Akashic Records are not mere data."
    },
    {
      "line": 507,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They are *potential*."
    },
    {
      "line": 508,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Unfiltered, they consume.\"** He gestured towards the crystalline archives. **\"Prove you understand consequence."
    },
    {
      "line": 509,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Prove you seek not just power, but wisdom’s anchor.\"** The implication was clear: Access required a demonstration of harmony beyond mere survival."
    },
    {
      "line": 510,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt felt the Star Needle emblem pulse against his chest."
    },
    {
      "line": 511,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Spire wasn’t just a tool."
    },
    {
      "line": 512,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was a responsibility echoing the Giants’ own guardianship."
    },
    {
      "line": 513,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He glanced at Jorik, whose hand rested protectively on his unique bow – a symbol of necessity tempered by purpose."
    },
    {
      "line": 514,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Humanity’s footprint wasn't just defiance."
    },
    {
      "line": 515,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was the understanding Althurion demanded."
    },
    {
      "line": 516,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt squared his shoulders."
    },
    {
      "line": 517,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Show me the trial.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 519,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The First Speaker gestured silently."
    },
    {
      "line": 520,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A section of the cloud plaza solidified into a vast, circular dais etched with harmonic sigils that pulsed faintly with inner light."
    },
    {
      "line": 521,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "At its center rested a plinth of flawless blue ice, holding a sphere of swirling, captured storm-light – raw, chaotic chroniton energy. **\"Harmonize the Vortex,\"** Althurion commanded, his harmonics resonating with grave finality. **\"Channel its fury into a stable resonance."
    },
    {
      "line": 522,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not suppression."
    },
    {
      "line": 523,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Integration."
    },
    {
      "line": 524,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Failure unravels the dais… and you.\"** The vortex hissed, lashing the air with temporal static that stung Geralt’s skin."
    },
    {
      "line": 525,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik instinctively stepped back, eyes wide."
    },
    {
      "line": 526,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt approached alone, his cracked applicator spitting warnings: *Chaotic chroniton density exceeding safe thresholds*."
    },
    {
      "line": 527,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zaron’s spirit within the armor flared, a low growl against the storm’s roar."
    },
    {
      "line": 528,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This wasn't brute force."
    },
    {
      "line": 529,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was precision conducting."
    },
    {
      "line": 530,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He closed his eyes, recalling Kaelen’s ruthless drills in the Nexus – feeling the rhythm beneath the chaos."
    },
    {
      "line": 531,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He extended his hands, applicator whining as he mapped the vortex’s jagged frequencies."
    },
    {
      "line": 532,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not dominance."
    },
    {
      "line": 533,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dialogue."
    },
    {
      "line": 534,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He wove his tripartite signature – armor’s defiant stability, applicator’s meticulous structure, his own unwavering focus on Mika’s retrieval – *into* the storm’s dissonance, seeking points of congruence, threads he could gently guide."
    },
    {
      "line": 536,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pain seared through him as the vortex resisted."
    },
    {
      "line": 537,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Temporal shards sliced psychic feedback across his mind."
    },
    {
      "line": 538,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He grounded himself in the image of the Whispering Stone's symbols, the Giants' own language of harmony."
    },
    {
      "line": 539,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Slowly, agonizingly, he found a screaming frequency within the storm and answered it not with force, but with a counter-harmony of focused purpose."
    },
    {
      "line": 540,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The vortex bucked violently."
    },
    {
      "line": 541,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A sigil on the dais flickered out."
    },
    {
      "line": 542,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt poured more will into the weave, his vision blurring."
    },
    {
      "line": 543,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He saw not just energy, but the potential Althurion warned of – timelines fracturing, knowledge devouring seekers."
    },
    {
      "line": 544,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He channeled that understanding into his resonance, shaping the fury into a pulsing, contained sphere of ordered light atop the plinth."
    },
    {
      "line": 545,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence fell abruptly, heavy and profound."
    },
    {
      "line": 546,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The storm-light was now a calm, humming orb."
    },
    {
      "line": 547,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt swayed, blood trickling from his nose."
    },
    {
      "line": 548,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The applicator's casing groaned."
    },
    {
      "line": 549,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Althurion nodded once, a deep, resonant hum vibrating from his chest. **\"Understanding witnessed.\"** He turned, leading them towards a towering archway carved from glacial ice. **\"The Heartpeak awaits.\"**"
    },
    {
      "line": 551,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Beyond the arch stretched a narrow causeway of pure, transparent ice spanning a fathomless chasm."
    },
    {
      "line": 552,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Far below, embedded like a splinter in the mountain’s core, pulsed the apex of the Needle Spire – a colossal spike of dark Annunaki metal humming with dormant power."
    },
    {
      "line": 553,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its chroniton resonance vibrated through Geralt’s bones, calling fiercely."
    },
    {
      "line": 554,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Althurion stopped at the causeway’s edge. **\"The Buried Resonance,\"** he intoned. **\"Its core remains dormant."
    },
    {
      "line": 555,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To activate its archive… you must resonate *with* its harmonics."
    },
    {
      "line": 556,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But know this: The spire’s activation echoes across the deep skein."
    },
    {
      "line": 557,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It will draw attention.\"** His pale sky-eyes held Geralt’s. **\"Is your purpose worth that beacon?\"** Geralt stared at the spire, feeling the applicator’s fractured shell resonate."
    },
    {
      "line": 558,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Purpose hardened within him."
    },
    {
      "line": 559,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika."
    },
    {
      "line": 560,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Five."
    },
    {
      "line": 561,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The scattered Legion."
    },
    {
      "line": 562,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It is,\" he stated, voice echoing in the frozen air."
    },
    {
      "line": 563,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He stepped onto the ice bridge."
    },
    {
      "line": 564,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Spire pulsed brighter."
    },
    {
      "line": 565,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The true configuration began."
    },
    {
      "line": 567,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Needle Spire’s resonance wasn't merely a hum; it was a complex lattice of chroniton pathways, layered and interwoven like Annunaki code."
    },
    {
      "line": 568,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt knelt before its apex, embedded in the icy floor of the Heartpeak cavern."
    },
    {
      "line": 569,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He placed his palms on the cold metal."
    },
    {
      "line": 570,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The applicator flared, projecting shimmering strands of light – fractured, but functional."
    },
    {
      "line": 571,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He felt the spire’s dormant potential: a repository designed for Akashic Records, yes, but fundamentally a *harvester*."
    },
    {
      "line": 572,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Built to siphon vrill energy from temporal eddies and channel it for power… or teleportation."
    },
    {
      "line": 573,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His lips thinned. *Annunaki tech.* Crude compared to his Void Spire training."
    },
    {
      "line": 574,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He didn't need vrill extraction."
    },
    {
      "line": 575,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He didn't crave unstable teleportation corridors between spiers."
    },
    {
      "line": 576,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He’d navigated the Continuum Nexus itself, where space-time flowed like water."
    },
    {
      "line": 577,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His need was sublime: a silent, surgical incision into the Akashic pathway itself."
    },
    {
      "line": 578,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To enter the vast halls he only vaguely remembers when he was summoned their when presented the armor by the aaon keepers themselves."
    },
    {
      "line": 579,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The void spiers..."
    },
    {
      "line": 580,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The needle spiers..."
    },
    {
      "line": 581,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They all share one fundamental connection.."
    },
    {
      "line": 582,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Grand spire."
    },
    {
      "line": 583,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This was not something the training provided."
    },
    {
      "line": 584,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This is the pulse, the pull tugging on his sleeve."
    },
    {
      "line": 585,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This is knowledge that chose you."
    },
    {
      "line": 586,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And it chose me."
    },
    {
      "line": 588,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His fingers danced in the air, guided by the applicator’s projections."
    },
    {
      "line": 589,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He bypassed the primary vrill collectors entirely."
    },
    {
      "line": 590,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Instead, he delved deep into the spire’s foundational chroniton lattice – a structure older than the Annunaki modifications."
    },
    {
      "line": 591,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He rewrote protocols, subverting the spire’s purpose."
    },
    {
      "line": 592,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He silenced the broadcast harmonics that would announce its activation across the skein."
    },
    {
      "line": 593,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No beacon."
    },
    {
      "line": 594,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No fanfare."
    },
    {
      "line": 595,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He programmed it not as a harvester or gate, but as a *key*."
    },
    {
      "line": 596,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A silent, resonant probe tuned solely to *his* tripartite signature – applicator, armor, will."
    },
    {
      "line": 597,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Its sole function: to map the deeper Akashic currents, seeking the unified connection."
    },
    {
      "line": 598,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He carved his intent into the spire’s core: The spire’s hum shifted, deepening into an almost imperceptible thrum beneath the mountain’s song."
    },
    {
      "line": 599,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Configuration complete."
    },
    {
      "line": 600,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silent."
    },
    {
      "line": 601,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Specific."
    },
    {
      "line": 602,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Undetectable."
    },
    {
      "line": 604,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cavern plunged into profound silence."
    },
    {
      "line": 605,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The spire’s dark metal now pulsed with a deep, internal light – resonant, but contained."
    },
    {
      "line": 606,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt felt its new purpose humming through his armor: To light, and to Sound.."
    },
    {
      "line": 607,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To Luminaire."
    },
    {
      "line": 608,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To the Resonant Keeper whose signature was the final compass."
    },
    {
      "line": 609,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He rose, turning towards the causeway."
    },
    {
      "line": 610,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Althurion watched, a silent mountain."
    },
    {
      "line": 611,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt met his gaze."
    },
    {
      "line": 612,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The spire sings only for my purpose,\" Geralt stated."
    },
    {
      "line": 613,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It brings no threat."
    },
    {
      "line": 614,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only answers.\" The Giant gave a slow, resonant nod. **\"Harmony endures.\"**"
    },
    {
      "line": 616,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik shifted his horn bow, eyes wide with awe."
    },
    {
      "line": 617,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt gripped his shoulder."
    },
    {
      "line": 618,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Stay sharp,\" he murmured."
    },
    {
      "line": 619,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The path ahead... it won't be stone.\" Jorik managed a tight nod."
    },
    {
      "line": 620,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Wherever it leads, Commander.\" Geralt turned back to the spire."
    },
    {
      "line": 621,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He didn't activate it."
    },
    {
      "line": 622,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He let his tripartite signature bleed into its newly forged lattice – applicator’s precision, armor’s defiance, his unwavering focus on Mika."
    },
    {
      "line": 623,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The spire *recognized* him."
    },
    {
      "line": 624,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air shimmered violently, not tearing, but *folding*."
    },
    {
      "line": 625,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reality buckled silently."
    },
    {
      "line": 626,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One heartbeat, Geralt and Jorik stood before the Heartpeak spire."
    },
    {
      "line": 627,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The next, they stood upon an obsidian stairwell descending into infinite darkness."
    },
    {
      "line": 628,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Behind them, the spire’s resonance faded like a closing door."
    },
    {
      "line": 630,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They descended."
    },
    {
      "line": 631,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The stairs were impossibly smooth, cold beneath their boots, each step echoing faintly into the abyss."
    },
    {
      "line": 632,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Around them, the Akashic Records unfolded."
    },
    {
      "line": 633,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not as dusty archives, but as living starscapes – constellations shifting into faces, battles, moments frozen in time."
    },
    {
      "line": 634,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Nebulae swirled into equations, galaxies condensed into whispered secrets."
    },
    {
      "line": 635,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air hummed with the weight of all existence, pressing against Geralt’s senses."
    },
    {
      "line": 636,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik gasped softly, stumbling as a phantom wave crashed silently beside them."
    },
    {
      "line": 637,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"It's... everything,\" he breathed, overwhelmed."
    },
    {
      "line": 639,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt kept his eyes fixed downward."
    },
    {
      "line": 640,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The stairs felt unfamiliar, yet deeply known."
    },
    {
      "line": 641,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They twisted, branched, reformed – not carved, but *willed* into being."
    },
    {
      "line": 642,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He wasn't following a path; he was forging it with every step, guided by the spire’s silent beacon towards Mika’s unique resonance."
    },
    {
      "line": 643,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The descent felt eternal, the starscape pressing closer, whispering forgotten lore and futures unmade."
    },
    {
      "line": 645,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Instinct screamed."
    },
    {
      "line": 646,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He halted, shoving Jorik back behind him."
    },
    {
      "line": 647,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air *crackled*."
    },
    {
      "line": 648,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Before them, the starfield fractured violently."
    },
    {
      "line": 649,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not stars, but *aspects*."
    },
    {
      "line": 650,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pure, blinding light coalesced into a radiant, feminine form – intent etched into its luminous contours."
    },
    {
      "line": 651,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Simultaneously, primal sound coalesced into a resonating, vibrating counterpart – raw, unstable power humming like an overloaded reactor."
    },
    {
      "line": 652,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They weren't separate entities."
    },
    {
      "line": 653,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were halves of a terrifying whole, moments after a catastrophic division."
    },
    {
      "line": 654,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Light Aspect pulsed with desperate navigational urgency – a map screaming its destination."
    },
    {
      "line": 655,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Sound Aspect vibrated with agonizing pressure, seeking release, a projectile primed for launch."
    },
    {
      "line": 657,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "*Prime Catalyst.* The knowledge slammed into Geralt – not learned, but *remembered* from the Heartpeak spire’s deep configuration."
    },
    {
      "line": 658,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This wasn’t Luminara *in* stasis."
    },
    {
      "line": 659,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This was Luminara *as* ignition."
    },
    {
      "line": 660,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Seed Jump was mid-flight."
    },
    {
      "line": 661,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Sound Aspect – the volatile Activator – was already hurtling through the chaos of the damaged Akashic pathways, aimed towards an impossibly distant Spire."
    },
    {
      "line": 662,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Success meant a new node ignited."
    },
    {
      "line": 663,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Failure meant… annihilation."
    },
    {
      "line": 664,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And the Light Aspect remained, the Locator, radiating frantic purpose, already calculating the next iteration should this one fail."
    },
    {
      "line": 666,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Light Aspect turned its luminous gaze upon Geralt."
    },
    {
      "line": 667,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It wasn't recognition; it was *assessment*."
    },
    {
      "line": 668,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Raw Akashic potential flowed around him, reacting to his tripartite signature."
    },
    {
      "line": 669,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The spire’s silent probe, tuned perfectly to Mika’s retrieval, resonated unexpectedly with the Locator’s desperate need."
    },
    {
      "line": 670,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt saw it: a fleeting harmonic overlap."
    },
    {
      "line": 671,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His configured spire wasn’t just a key; it was a potential anchor point *within* the chaotic jump-pathway Luminara had been forced to use."
    },
    {
      "line": 672,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Light Aspect shifted, its navigational focus momentarily locking onto *him*."
    },
    {
      "line": 673,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The implication was staggering: His presence offered a stable resonance point amidst the chaos."
    },
    {
      "line": 674,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A lifeline."
    },
    {
      "line": 675,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A chance for the Catalyst’s halves to synchronize *now*, bypassing the perilous void-crossing."
    },
    {
      "line": 676,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The risk was immense – stabilizing that volatile Sound Aspect mid-transit could tear reality apart."
    },
    {
      "line": 677,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But the Light Aspect, the essence of Luminara’s persistent will, flowed towards Geralt, resonating with his purpose."
    },
    {
      "line": 678,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It wasn't asking permission."
    },
    {
      "line": 679,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was *choosing* the anchor he represented."
    },
    {
      "line": 680,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air screamed with impending fusion."
    },
    {
      "line": 682,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Commander!\""
    },
    {
      "line": 683,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik yelled, staggering back as primal harmonics threatened to shatter his bones. Geralt braced himself, Star Needle applicator flaring crimson warnings. He saw the Light Aspect – pure information, Mika’s face flickering within its luminous matrix – merge with his tripartite signature. It wasn't possession; it was resonance amplification. His senses exploded. Suddenly, he perceived the Sound Half’s terrifying trajectory: a screaming comet of raw chroniton fury hurtling through a corridor where spatial dimensions frayed like rotten cloth. It was nanoseconds from catastrophic dispersion. The Light Aspect *used* Geralt’s spire-tuned awareness, projecting Mika’s resonant signature like a homing flare directly into the Sound Half’s path. Not guidance. A *command*. *Redirect.* The Sound Aspect obeyed instantly, violently altering course. It wasn't heading for a distant spire anymore. It was plunging *towards them*."
    },
    {
      "line": 685,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Impact was imminent."
    },
    {
      "line": 686,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt acted on pure Void Spire instinct."
    },
    {
      "line": 687,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He didn't fight the Catalyst’s flow; he *conducted* it."
    },
    {
      "line": 688,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shoving Jorik bodily behind him onto a solidified step-platform, Geralt slammed his palms downward onto the obsidian stair."
    },
    {
      "line": 689,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Star Needle applicator shrieked, projecting latticework harmonics directly into the Akashic substrate."
    },
    {
      "line": 690,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He didn't try to contain the Sound Aspect's fury."
    },
    {
      "line": 691,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He *channeled* it."
    },
    {
      "line": 692,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Using the Light Aspect’s navigational precision flooding his mind, he shaped the screaming chroniton torrent into a focused beam, directing its colossal energy *through* the stair beneath his hands."
    },
    {
      "line": 693,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The obsidian underfoot didn't shatter; it *resonated*, transforming into a lens of pure harmonic potential."
    },
    {
      "line": 694,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Sound Aspect struck the focal point."
    },
    {
      "line": 695,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Light and Sound collided not with destruction, but with blinding, resonant *integration*."
    },
    {
      "line": 696,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The stairwell vanished in a silent detonation of stabilized power."
    },
    {
      "line": 698,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Silence descended, thick and profound."
    },
    {
      "line": 699,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Akashic starscape slowly reformed around them."
    },
    {
      "line": 700,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Standing where the focal point had been, radiating impossible calm amidst fading chroniton sparks, was Luminara: whole, unified, and terrifyingly present."
    },
    {
      "line": 701,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her eyes, swirling galaxies of ancient knowledge, fixed on Geralt."
    },
    {
      "line": 702,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A faint harmonic hum resonated deep within Jorik's bones – the newly anchored Spire node, born not on a distant world, but *here*, within the Akashic pathway itself."
    },
    {
      "line": 703,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara inclined her head, her voice a chorus echoing with the weight of countless Seed Jumps."
    },
    {
      "line": 704,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"You provided the anchor, Resonant Keeper."
    },
    {
      "line": 705,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An unforeseen variable.\" Her gaze shifted towards the depths where Mika’s signature pulsed faintly."
    },
    {
      "line": 706,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Now."
    },
    {
      "line": 707,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Shall we retrieve what *you* seek?\""
    },
    {
      "line": 709,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The implications slammed into Geralt."
    },
    {
      "line": 710,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara wasn’t a destination; she was the ignition key itself, cyclically sacrificing fragments of her essence across the cosmos."
    },
    {
      "line": 711,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His spire-tuned resonance hadn't just illuminated Mika’s location; it had offered the Catalyst a stable fulcrum mid-leap, transforming a desperate void-crossing into instantaneous integration."
    },
    {
      "line": 712,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This node wasn't merely *activated*; it was *forged* around his purpose."
    },
    {
      "line": 713,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The risk hadn't vanished; it had merely shifted form."
    },
    {
      "line": 714,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stabilizing the volatile Activator mid-flight had anchored Luminara *here*, within the Akashic flow, tying her immense power directly to Geralt’s quest."
    },
    {
      "line": 715,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her presence wasn't passive aid; it was a live conduit to the deepest currents of existence."
    },
    {
      "line": 717,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara stepped forward, her form shimmering slightly."
    },
    {
      "line": 718,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Your Legion Commander,\" she stated, her voice resonating with the Akashic pulse, \"did not merely endure the void."
    },
    {
      "line": 719,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They *clung*.\" She gestured, and the starscape fractured into a vision: soldiers adrift in temporal eddies, drowning in oblivion."
    },
    {
      "line": 720,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Then, a familiar resonance pulsed – Mika’s raw, desperate focus on Geralt’s survival, amplified by the temporal bleed rippling from his assault on Xal'Zirith’s scar."
    },
    {
      "line": 721,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Your fury tore the scar, Geralt, but it spilled chroniton chaos outward."
    },
    {
      "line": 722,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Within that bleed, Mika’s unwavering belief in you became a lifeline."
    },
    {
      "line": 723,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her echo of existence, her primal drive to reunite, resonated across the Eddy.\" The vision shifted: warriors latching onto Mika’s psychic signature, pulled from non-existence not by Geralt’s straining hands, but by the anchor forged from *her* love and *his* relentless refusal to yield."
    },
    {
      "line": 724,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Where others felt loss, you pushed harder."
    },
    {
      "line": 725,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Your determination sculpted the Eddy itself."
    },
    {
      "line": 726,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Your Legion didn’t escape oblivion."
    },
    {
      "line": 727,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were *salvaged* by the bond you share.\" Luminara’s galactic eyes held his."
    },
    {
      "line": 728,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"This node isn’t just my anchor."
    },
    {
      "line": 729,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It’s the confluence of your purpose.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 730,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "////////"
    },
    {
      "line": 732,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara's form flickered, translucent at the edges."
    },
    {
      "line": 733,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"I am... incomplete still.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 734,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her voice held strain"
    },
    {
      "line": 735,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "beneath its harmonic resonance."
    },
    {
      "line": 736,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"What you see here –"
    },
    {
      "line": 737,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Light and Sound reunified – is my consciousness"
    },
    {
      "line": 738,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "restored within the Akashic flow.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 740,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She gestured downward, toward the archway."
    },
    {
      "line": 741,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"But I am"
    },
    {
      "line": 742,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Resonant Keeper."
    },
    {
      "line": 743,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Light to navigate."
    },
    {
      "line": 744,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sound to activate. but I cannot persist in this form forever, when I can bring these energies together, I can manifest into the material existence .\""
    },
    {
      "line": 746,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her form wavered, unable to solidify."
    },
    {
      "line": 747,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"My material"
    },
    {
      "line": 748,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "aspect remains a corrupted connection."
    },
    {
      "line": 749,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I cannot take form"
    },
    {
      "line": 750,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "in your world."
    },
    {
      "line": 751,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cannot walk solid ground."
    },
    {
      "line": 752,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Cannot manifest"
    },
    {
      "line": 753,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "beyond these walls.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 755,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A vision flashed: a pyramid, roots coiling around"
    },
    {
      "line": 756,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "obsidian, corruption bleeding through water, a"
    },
    {
      "line": 757,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "luminous potential struggling to materialize."
    },
    {
      "line": 759,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"Free my material anchor, Geralt. Purge what prevents"
    },
    {
      "line": 760,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "my manifestation."
    },
    {
      "line": 761,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only then can I *choose* physical form."
    },
    {
      "line": 762,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Only then can I walk beside you.\""
    },
    {
      "line": 766,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "///////////"
    },
    {
      "line": 768,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The stairs beneath them rippled."
    },
    {
      "line": 769,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Obsidian smoothed into polished black stone, veined with faint, pulsing chroniton light."
    },
    {
      "line": 770,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "An archway materialized ahead, framing not starscapes, but a familiar, shadowed corridor."
    },
    {
      "line": 771,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air shifted – damp stone, ozone, and the distant murmur of voices."
    },
    {
      "line": 772,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt knew this scent, this resonance."
    },
    {
      "line": 773,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Echo Tower."
    },
    {
      "line": 774,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Zypher’s domain."
    },
    {
      "line": 775,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Where Mika had marched his resurrected warriors."
    },
    {
      "line": 776,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Where Geralt had felt only phantom traces before."
    },
    {
      "line": 777,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Now, the connection blazed like a beacon."
    },
    {
      "line": 778,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Jorik inhaled sharply beside him, gripping his bow tighter."
    },
    {
      "line": 779,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Sir... that’s...\""
    },
    {
      "line": 781,
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unknown",
      "text": "\"The way down,\""
    },
    {
      "line": 782,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt finished, his voice rough. Below that Akashic library lay the path not just to answers, but to *her*. To the Legion pulled back from the brink by the force of Mika’s faith and his own indomitable will. The stairs solidified, leading unmistakly towards the archway. Through it, Geralt glimpsed flickering torchlight on rough-hewn stone – the entrance hall of the Echo Tower. He could almost hear the muffled tread of boots, the low hum of displaced warriors grounding themselves. He felt Mika’s presence there, a fierce, familiar warmth cutting through the Tower’s psychic chill. She was close. Real. Waiting."
    },
    {
      "line": 784,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Luminara remained behind, a silent sentinel at the confluence."
    },
    {
      "line": 785,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The path is open,\" she resonated, her form beginning to dissolve back into the Akashic flow."
    },
    {
      "line": 786,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"This place is yours as needed throughout your journey, ill be here awaiting, but go, Claim your reward, Resonant Keeper."
    },
    {
      "line": 787,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The echoes await their Commander.\" Geralt didn't hesitate."
    },
    {
      "line": 788,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He strode forward, Jorik a step behind, the applicator humming softly, no longer screaming warnings but resonating with anticipation."
    },
    {
      "line": 789,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air thickened as they passed through the archway, the weight of the Akashic Records lifting, replaced by the tangible, charged atmosphere of the Tower."
    },
    {
      "line": 790,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Torchlight danced on the walls ahead."
    },
    {
      "line": 791,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Around a bend, voices grew clearer – the low murmur of soldiers, a sharp command ringing out."
    },
    {
      "line": 792,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s voice."
    },
    {
      "line": 793,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt quickened his pace, the final steps echoing loudly in the sudden quiet of the corridor."
    },
    {
      "line": 794,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He rounded the corner.."
    },
    {
      "line": 795,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Salt crunched under his boot."
    },
    {
      "line": 796,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika stiffened, sensing presence."
    },
    {
      "line": 797,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Slowly, she turned."
    },
    {
      "line": 798,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her eyes widened, disbelief warring with desperate hope."
    },
    {
      "line": 799,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Geralt?\" Her voice cracked."
    },
    {
      "line": 800,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"You... forged the path?\""
    },
    {
      "line": 802,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The corridor fell utterly silent."
    },
    {
      "line": 803,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Soldiers froze mid-motion, mouths agape."
    },
    {
      "line": 804,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Oreck’s lenses snapped into focus."
    },
    {
      "line": 805,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Dren dropped a water canteen, its clatter echoing strangely."
    },
    {
      "line": 806,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt stood framed in the archway, dust from the void swirling faintly around his boots, his dragon armor gleaming dully in the torchlight, eyes locked solely on Mika."
    },
    {
      "line": 807,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Months of separation, of battles fought across fractured timelines, of feeling her absence like a phantom limb, vanished in the raw shock of reunion."
    },
    {
      "line": 808,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika’s breath hitched."
    },
    {
      "line": 809,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The fierce Commander dissolved, replaced by the woman who’d believed against oblivion."
    },
    {
      "line": 810,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She took one faltering step forward, then another, breaking into a run."
    },
    {
      "line": 811,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"GERALT!\" She crashed into him, arms wrapping around his armored torso with bone-jarring force."
    },
    {
      "line": 812,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He caught her instantly, crushing her against him, his face burying in her sweat-streaked hair, inhaling the scent of ozone, dust, and *her*."
    },
    {
      "line": 813,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His arms trembled, holding her as if she were the only solid thing in a dissolving universe."
    },
    {
      "line": 814,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "It was fierce, desperate, wordless – a physical reclaiming after lifetimes spent adrift."
    },
    {
      "line": 815,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Months of agonized separation dissolved in that fierce pressure, the sheer, undeniable *reality* of her warmth against him."
    },
    {
      "line": 817,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The intensity of her embrace, the desperate grip of her fingers digging into the seams of his armor, momentarily shattered the dark weight crushing Geralt’s chest."
    },
    {
      "line": 818,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He felt Mika’s heartbeat hammering against his own, a frantic counterpoint to the fading hum of the Star Needle applicator."
    },
    {
      "line": 819,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But as the initial wave of euphoria receded, the horror flooded back – the temporal storm tearing through his grasp, the faces of his soldiers vanishing into the rip, the crushing certainty of *failure*."
    },
    {
      "line": 820,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He pulled back slightly, just enough to see Mika’s tear-streaked face gazing up at him, radiant with relief."
    },
    {
      "line": 821,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His own face twisted."
    },
    {
      "line": 822,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Mika... the Legion...\" he choked out, the words thick with anguish."
    },
    {
      "line": 823,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The Eddy..."
    },
    {
      "line": 824,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I had them..."
    },
    {
      "line": 825,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I *felt* them... and then... gone."
    },
    {
      "line": 826,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Torn away."
    },
    {
      "line": 827,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I failed them."
    },
    {
      "line": 828,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Again.\" He tried to pull back further, the burden unbearable."
    },
    {
      "line": 829,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika instantly tightened her grip, her hand flying up to cup his scarred cheek."
    },
    {
      "line": 830,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"No!\" she commanded, her voice raw but fierce."
    },
    {
      "line": 831,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Look at me!"
    },
    {
      "line": 832,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Don't!"
    },
    {
      "line": 833,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Don't you *dare* go back there!\" Her eyes blazed, anchoring him in the present moment, in the press of her body against his."
    },
    {
      "line": 835,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He stopped, swallowing hard, forcing his gaze to stay locked with hers."
    },
    {
      "line": 836,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The visceral memory of loss battled the undeniable press of her against him."
    },
    {
      "line": 837,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He took a shuddering breath, trying to obey, to stay *here*."
    },
    {
      "line": 838,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As the internal storm subsided enough for him to truly focus, his gaze shifted past Mika’s shoulder."
    },
    {
      "line": 839,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He saw Dren standing nearby, alive, whole, staring at him with bewildered eyes."
    },
    {
      "line": 840,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt froze."
    },
    {
      "line": 841,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Utterly still."
    },
    {
      "line": 842,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His breath caught."
    },
    {
      "line": 843,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He stared, comprehension dawning slowly, impossibly."
    },
    {
      "line": 844,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He looked back at Mika, his brow furrowed in profound confusion."
    },
    {
      "line": 845,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She understood instantly."
    },
    {
      "line": 846,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A slow, compassionate smile touched her lips, fierce pride mixing with shared sorrow."
    },
    {
      "line": 847,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"You saved them, Geralt,\" she said softly, her voice thick with emotion."
    },
    {
      "line": 848,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her hand slid down to grip his armored forearm."
    },
    {
      "line": 849,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"You fought the storm."
    },
    {
      "line": 850,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You held the door open... long enough."
    },
    {
      "line": 851,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And *we*,\" she gestured slightly towards the gathered warriors, \"we pulled them back."
    },
    {
      "line": 852,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Through the bleed."
    },
    {
      "line": 853,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Your fury tore the scar, but your strength held the path."
    },
    {
      "line": 854,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Hers pulled them through."
    },
    {
      "line": 855,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Together."
    },
    {
      "line": 856,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Your fight, my anchor.\" Dren stepped forward hesitantly."
    },
    {
      "line": 857,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Commander?"
    },
    {
      "line": 858,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sir... we felt you."
    },
    {
      "line": 859,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Pushing us out... before the door slammed shut.\" Understanding washed over Geralt in a wave – the agonizing push he’d made, the despair of letting go... and Mika intercepting, pulling them from the brink."
    },
    {
      "line": 860,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Failure and salvation intertwined."
    },
    {
      "line": 861,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He looked from Dren back to Mika, the crushing weight lifting, replaced by a staggering awe."
    },
    {
      "line": 862,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He pulled Mika fiercely back into his arms, burying his face in her neck, no words needed, just the shared, shuddering breath of impossible reunion."
    },
    {
      "line": 863,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Relief, profound exhaustion, and a burgeoning, fierce joy vibrated between them."
    },
    {
      "line": 864,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The army remained hushed, bearing witness to the quiet storm of their leaders' embrace."
    },
    {
      "line": 866,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He held her tighter still, the tremor in his arms easing only slightly as the truth settled deep within his bones."
    },
    {
      "line": 867,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Months of battling temporal chaos, forcing his way through impossible voids, moments bleeding into centuries – all compressed into the unrelenting pressure of maintaining his grip on that collapsing Eddy."
    },
    {
      "line": 868,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The sheer exhaustion crashed over him now, a physical weight dragging at his limbs, but it was drowned out by the undeniable heat of Mika against him, the scent of her sweat and ozone anchoring him firmly in *now*."
    },
    {
      "line": 869,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He lifted his head just enough to see her face again, her eyes shining with unshed tears and fierce triumph."
    },
    {
      "line": 870,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Together,\" he rasped, the single word echoing the core tenet that had driven him through the storm."
    },
    {
      "line": 871,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His gaze swept past her shoulder once more, taking in the assembled warriors – faces he’d mourned, soldiers whose absence had carved a canyon through his spirit."
    },
    {
      "line": 872,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They stood solid."
    },
    {
      "line": 873,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Real."
    },
    {
      "line": 874,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Their presence wasn't just a miracle; it was a testament to the bond Mika spoke of."
    },
    {
      "line": 875,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His desperate push, her unwavering pull."
    },
    {
      "line": 876,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A choked sound escaped him, half-laugh, half-sob."
    },
    {
      "line": 877,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He pressed his forehead to hers, the dragon armor humming softly against her skin, resonating with the profound relief vibrating through him."
    },
    {
      "line": 878,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Echo Tower corridor faded, the harsh light softening around the undeniable reality he held."
    },
    {
      "line": 880,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The silence stretched, profound but comfortable, heavy with shared understanding and unspoken grief transmuting into shared strength."
    },
    {
      "line": 881,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt finally loosened his grasp slightly, though he kept Mika firmly within the circle of his arms, his hand resting possessively on the small of her back."
    },
    {
      "line": 882,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He looked towards Oreck, whose impassive lenses betrayed nothing, yet conveyed volumes."
    },
    {
      "line": 883,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "A nod passed between them – acknowledgment, respect, shared burden."
    },
    {
      "line": 884,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt's gaze then swept across the ranks, meeting the eyes of soldiers he had led into oblivion and Mika had dragged back into existence."
    },
    {
      "line": 885,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He saw their confusion still, the lingering horror of non-being, but also a dawning certainty."
    },
    {
      "line": 886,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were *here*."
    },
    {
      "line": 887,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Because he hadn't yielded completely, and because she hadn't stopped believing."
    },
    {
      "line": 888,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The impossible had been achieved."
    },
    {
      "line": 889,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not by one, but by two wills fused in purpose across the fractured timelines."
    },
    {
      "line": 890,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The air still hummed faintly with the Tower’s psychic residue, but it was overshadowed by the tangible pulse of two hundred and fifty hearts beating strong."
    },
    {
      "line": 891,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt straightened his shoulders, the weariness still present but now channeled into a renewed resolve."
    },
    {
      "line": 892,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He met Mika’s eyes again, a flicker of the old fire returning to his own."
    },
    {
      "line": 893,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"The Sage?\" he asked, his voice steadier now, grounding them both in the next step."
    },
    {
      "line": 895,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Mika nodded, her eyes reflecting his resolve."
    },
    {
      "line": 896,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She didn't pull away entirely, her hand resting firmly on his armored chest plate."
    },
    {
      "line": 897,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Ahead,\" she confirmed, her voice regaining its Commander's edge, yet softened by the lingering intimacy of their reunion."
    },
    {
      "line": 898,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She gestured towards the corridor leading deeper into the Tower."
    },
    {
      "line": 899,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Answers."
    },
    {
      "line": 900,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Maybe... a way.\" Her gaze held his, acknowledging the unspoken hope – the possibility woven into Zypher's promise and the Sage's ancient knowledge."
    },
    {
      "line": 901,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They stood united, commanders once more, the shared trauma of loss and retrieval forging an unbreakable bond."
    },
    {
      "line": 902,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The army shifted behind them, boots scraping on salt-crusted stone, ready to follow wherever they led."
    },
    {
      "line": 903,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Geralt inhaled deeply, the air tasting of ozone, ancient stone, and the faint, metallic tang of temporal energy."
    },
    {
      "line": 904,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He squeezed Mika’s shoulder once, a silent affirmation, then turned his gaze towards the shadowed passage."
    },
    {
      "line": 905,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "\"Then we go,\" he stated, stepping forward, Mika falling naturally into step beside him."
    },
    {
      "line": 906,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The echoes of their desperate struggle faded behind them as they moved as one towards the heart of the Tower and the mysteries it held."
    },
    {
      "line": 907,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The collective breath of the Legion released, a low sigh of anticipation mingling with the soft tramp of boots echoing into the obsidian depths."
    },
    {
      "line": 910,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "End of chapter 35"
    }
  ]
}